    thinking: "**Confirming Project Milestone**\n\nI\'ve successfully passed all 31 pure logic tests! The `npm run check:release` script runs without issues and clearly lists all outstanding TODOs. I\'m now transitioning focus to constructing the React context/providers, Sketch Kit, core UI primitives, and the Footer additive edits. I\'m about to thoroughly review the four additive edits to `src/components/ui/doodle`.\n\n\n**Defining New UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now integrating the new crew and doodle kinds into the system. Specifically, I\'m working on the `nodey` and `sapling` crew types. The `nodey` will be a cube-shaped character, complete with wobbly edges and a five-petal blossom. I\'m also adding a `sapling` that looks like a thin stem with leaves and seed pod eyes. New doodle types, a petal and a tiny 3/4 cube, are being defined for use.\n\n\n"
