  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Core Functionality**\n\nI\'ve just re-run the core test file, `doodle-crew-footer.test.ts`, and confirmed that the helper functions still pass after the recent edits. Now, I\'m shifting focus to designing the Sketch Kit, starting with the `LineBoilFilters` component within the `src/components/sketch/` directory.\n\n\n**Defining Sketch Kit Components**\n\nI\'m now outlining the components for the Sketch Kit. I\'ve considered `LineBoilFilters`, a hidden SVG element with various petal nodes and a hook to manage the animation rate. I\'ve also thought about a `PaperBackground` component that wraps content with a paper-like surface, and `RoughBox` which leverages ResizeObserver and GSAP\'s DrawSVG. Further, there\'s `RoughHighlight` with roughjs paths, `InkArrow` for hand-drawn arrows, `WashiTape` for semi-transparent tapes, and `Polaroid`, which I have yet to fully define.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "flEAa-D2HJrZ7M8PoICQ4Q8"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9936294702554350452"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import * as React from \\\"react\\\";\\nimport { useReducedMotion } from \\\"@/app/QualityProvider\\\";\\n\\nexport function LineBoilFilters() {\\n  return (\\n    <svg\\n      aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n      width=\\\"0\\\"\\n      height=\\\"0\\\"\\n      style={{ position: \\\"absolute\\\", width: 0, height: 0, overflow: \\\"hidden\\\" }}\\n    >\\n      <defs>\\n        {[0, 1, 2].map((k) => (\\n          <filter\\n            key={k}\\n            id={`petalnode-boil-${k}`}\\n            x=\\\"-12%\\\"\\n            y=\\\"-12%\\\"\\n            width=\\\"124%\\\"\\n            height=\\\"124%\\\"\\n          >\\n            <feTurbulence\\n              type=\\\"fractalNoise\\\"\\n              baseFrequency=\\\"0.032\\\"\\n              numOctaves=\\\"2\\\"\\n              seed={k * 11 + 5}\\n              result=\\\"noise\\\"\\n            />\\n            <feDisplacementMap\\n              in=\\\"SourceGraphic\\\"\\n              in2=\\\"noise\\\"\\n              scale=\\\"2.1\\\"\\n              xChannelSelector=\\\"R\\\"\\n              yChannelSelector=\\\"G\\\"\\n            />\\n          </filter>\\n        ))}\\n      </defs>\\n    </svg>\\n  );\\n}\\n\\nexport function useBoilFilter(enabled = true): string | undefined {\\n  const reducedMotion = useReducedMotion();\\n  const [frame, setFrame] = React.useState(0);\\n\\n  React.useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!enabled || reducedMotion) return;\\n    const id = window.setInterval(() => {\\n      setFrame((f) => (f + 1) % 3);\\n    }, 125); // ~8 fps\\n    return () => window.clearInterval(id);\\n  }, [enabled, reducedMotion]);\\n\\n  if (!enabled || reducedMotion) return undefined;\\n  return `url(#petalnode-boil-${frame})`;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create shared 8fps living-ink SVG line boil filters and hook\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/sketch/LineBoilFilters.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing LineBoilFilters component\", \"toolSummary\"