  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing the Layout & Scene**\n\nI\'m currently focused on constructing the site\'s layout chrome components like `Nav`, `PageShell`, and `DevTodoBadge`. Simultaneously, I\'m working on the SVG island illustrations, including `SeedSketchSvg` for the hero pre-load and `IslandSketchSvg` for the cumulative static version. I\'m also starting to put the 3D scene together, focusing on `SketchEffect`, `PostFX`, and the `Island` components.\n\n\n**Designing the Nav Component**\n\nI\'m now carefully designing the `Nav` component, following the specifications in `03 \302\2473`. The desktop version includes logo, navigation links (\"How it works\", \"Plans\", etc.), and a CTA button. I\'m focusing on the component\'s behavior: its transitions between a transparent state and a taped paper strip based on scroll position, and its hiding/revealing behavior, especially when the story is pinned.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "uVEAa4SiMcWsvdIPidLU0QQ"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1921497680094519693"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import * as React from \\\"react\\\";\\nimport { Link, useLocation, useNavigate } from \\\"react-router-dom\\\";\\nimport { ExternalLink, Menu } from \\\"lucide-react\\\";\\nimport { brand, isTodo, links, nav } from \\\"@/content\\\";\\nimport { Nodey, StickerButton, WashiTape } from \\\"@/components/sketch\\\";\\nimport {\\n  Sheet,\\n  SheetContent,\\n  SheetTitle,\\n  SheetTrigger,\\n} from \\\"@/components/ui/sheet\\\";\\nimport { useSmoothScroll } from \\\"@/app/SmoothScroll\\\";\\nimport { chapterStart } from \\\"@/lib/storyStore\\\";\\nimport { cn } from \\\"@/lib/utils\\\";\\n\\nexport function Nav() {\\n  const location = useLocation();\\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\\n  const { scrollToStoryProgress, scrollToTarget } = useSmoothScroll();\\n  const [scrolled, setScrolled] = React.useState(false);\\n  const [hidden, setHidden] = React.useState(false);\\n  const [sheetOpen, setSheetOpen] = React.useState(false);\\n  const lastYRef = React.useRef(0);\\n\\n  React.useEffect(() => {\\n    const onScroll = () => {\\n      const y = window.scrollY;\\n      const delta = y - lastYRef.current;\\n      setScrolled(y > 80);\\n\\n      // Determine if pinned story is currently in view\\n      const storyEl = document.getElementById(\\\"story\\\");\\n      let inStoryPin = false;\\n      if (storyEl && location.pathname === \\\"/\\\") {\\n        const rect = storyEl.getBoundingClientRect();\\n        inStoryPin = rect.top <= 0 && rect.bottom > window.innerHeight * 0.6;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (y <= 40) {\\n        setHidden(false);\\n      } else if (delta > 6) {\\n        setHidden(true);\\n      } else if (delta < -6) {\\n        setHidden(false);\\n      } else if (inStoryPin && delta >= 0) {\\n        setHidden(true);\\n      }\\n      lastYRef.current = y;\\n    };\\n\\n    window.addEventListener(\\\"scroll\\\", onScroll, { passive: true });\\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(\\\"scroll\\\", onScroll);\\n  }, [location.pathname]);\\n\\n  const handleHowItWorks = (e: React.MouseEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    setSheetOpen(false);\\n    if (location.pathname !== \\\"/\\\") {\\n      navigate(\\\"/#roots\\\");\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const staticRoots = document.getElementById(\\\"chapter-roots\\\");\\n    if (staticRoots) {\\n      scrollToTarget(staticRoots, -20);\\n    } else {\\n      scrollToStoryProgress(chapterStart(\\\"roots\\\") + 0.01);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const isDev = import.meta.env.DEV;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header\\n      className={cn(\\n        \\\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 transition-transform duration-300\\\",\\n        hidden ? \\\"-translate-y-[125%]\\\" : \\\"translate-y-0\\\",\\n      )}\\n    >\\n      <div className=\\\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-3\\\">\\n        <div\\n          className={cn(\\n            \\\"relative flex items-center justify-between gap-6 px-4 py-2.5 transition-all duration-200\\\",\\n            scrolled\\n              ? \\\"bg-paper border-2 border-ink shadow-[4px_4px_0_var(--color-ink)] rounded-sm\\\"\\n              : \\\"bg-transparent border-2 border-transparent\\\",\\n          )}\\n        >\\n          {scrolled && (\\n            <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-3 right-10 hidden sm:block\\\">\\n              <WashiTape rotation={5} length={72} />\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Zone 1: Brand logo */}\\n          <Link\\n            to=\\\"/\\\"\\n            onClick={() => setSheetOpen(false)}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 group focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-dashed focus-visible:outline-ink focus-visible:outline-offset-4 rounded-sm\\\"\\n          >\\n            <span className=\\\"inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-ink bg-paper shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--color-ink)] transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:-rotate-6\\\">\\n              <Nodey size={26} boil={false} />\\n            </span>\\n            <span className=\\\"font-display-tight text-xl text-ink lowercase\\\">\\n              {brand.logoText}\\n            </span>\\n          </Link>\\n\\n          {/* Zone 2: Desktop nav links */}\\n          <nav\\n            aria-label=\\\"Primary\\\"\\n            className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-7 text-[15px] font-bold text-ink\\\"\\n          >\\n            <a\\n              href=\\\"/#roots\\\"\\n              onClick={handleHowItWorks}\\n              className=\\\"whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 hover:text-blossom-600 transition-colors underline-offset-4 hover:underline decoration-wavy decoration-blossom-600\\\"\\n            >\\n              {nav.howItWorksLabel}\\n            </a>\\n            <Link\\n              to=\\\"/plans\\\"\\n              className={cn(\\n                \\\"whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 hover:text-blossom-600 transition-colors underline-offset-4 hover:underline decoration-wavy decoration-blossom-600\\\",\\n                location.pathname === \\\"/plans\\\" && \\\"text-blossom-600 underline\\\",\\n              )}\\n            >\\n              {nav.plansLabel}\\n            </Link>\\n            {nav.externalItems.map((item) => {\\n              const todo = isTodo(item.href);\\n              return (\\n                <a\\n                  key={item.label}\\n                  href={item.href}\\n                  target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n                  rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\n                  onClick={(e) => {\\n                    if (todo) e.preventDefault();\\n                  }}\\n                  title={todo && isDev ? \\\"TODO: link\\\" : undefined}\\n                  className={cn(\\n                    \\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 hover:text-blossom-600 transition-colors underline-offset-4 hover:underline decoration-wavy decoration-blossom-600\\\",\\n                    todo && isDev && \\\"border-b border-dashed border-blossom-600/60\\\",\\n                  )}\\n                >\\n                  <span>{item.label}</span>\\n                  <ExternalLink className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5 opacity-70\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                </a>\\n              );\\n            })}\\n          </nav>\\n\\n          {/* Zone 3: Primary CTA + Mobile Sheet */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n            <StickerButton\\n              href={nav.ctaHref}\\n              external\\n              variant=\\\"primary\\\"\\n              size=\\\"sm\\\"\\n              className=\\\"hidden sm:inline-flex\\\"\\n            >\\n              {nav.ctaLabel}\\n            </StickerButton>\\n\\n            <Sheet open={sheetOpen} onOpenChange={setSheetOpen}>\\n              <SheetTrigger asChild>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  aria-label=\\\"Open menu\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"lg:hidden inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border-2 border-ink bg-paper text-ink shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--color-ink)] hover:bg-blossom-50 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <Menu className=\\\"h-5 w-5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                </button>\\n              </SheetTrigger>\\n              <SheetContent>\\n                <SheetTitle className=\\\"font-handwriting text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-6\\\">\\n                  {brand.logoText} notebook\\n                </SheetTitle>\\n                <nav aria-label=\\\"Mobile\\\" className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-4 flex-1\\\">\\n                  <a\\n                    href=\\\"/#roots\\\"\\n                    onClick={handleHowItWorks}\\n                    className=\\\"font-handwriting text-xl font-semibold text-ink hover:text-blossom-600 py-1.5\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    {nav.howItWorksLabel}\\n                  </a>\\n                  <Link\\n                    to=\\\"/plans\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setSheetOpen(false)}\\n                    className=\\\"font-handwriting text-xl font-semibold text-ink hover:text-blossom-600 py-1.5\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    {nav.plansLabel}\\n                  </Link>\\n                  {nav.externalItems.map((item) => {\\n                    const todo = isTodo(item.href);\\n                    return (\\n                      <a\\n                        key={item.label}\\n                        href={item.href}\\n                        target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n                        rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\n                        onClick={(e) => {\\n                          if (todo) e.preventDefault();\\n                          setSheetOpen(false);\\n                        }}\\n                        title={todo && isDev ? \\\"TODO: link\\\" : undefined}\\n                        className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-handwriting text-xl font-semibold text-ink hover:text-blossom-600 py-1.5\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <span>{item.label}</span>\\n                        <ExternalLink className=\\\"h-4 w-4 opacity-70\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                      </a>\\n                    );\\n                  })}\\n                </nav>\\n                <div className=\\\"pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-paper-line\\\">\\n                  <StickerButton\\n                    href={links.store}\\n                    external\\n                    variant=\\\"primary\\\"\\n                    size=\\\"lg\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"w-full\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setSheetOpen(false)}\\n                  >\\n                    {nav.ctaLabel}\\n                  </StickerButton>\\n                </div>\\n              </SheetContent>\\n            </Sheet>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create Petalnode sticky-taped Nav and ruled-notebook mobile Sheet menu\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/layout/Nav.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing Nav and mobile Sheet menu\", \"toolSummary\":\"Write src/components/layout/Nav.tsx\"}"
