  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Bokeh Parameters**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the `RealisticBokehEffect` and its critical parameters. Specifically, I\'m examining how `texelSize`, `cameraNear`, `cameraFar`, and depth values interact. I\'m especially interested in how `readDepth(uv)` is used in conjunction with `perspectiveDepthToViewZ` and `viewZToOrthographicDepth`. The interplay seems key to simulating the depth-of-field effect.\n\n\n**Verifying World Position Calculation**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the world position reconstruction from `uv` and `depth`. I\'ve confirmed the math using `uInvProjectionMatrix` and `uCameraMatrixWorld` uniforms, and this allows us to get exact **world position**. The code correctly maps `uv` and `depth` from normalized device coordinates to view space and then to world space! It is important to note the special case of sky pixels where no geometry is present.\n\n\n**Investigating Reveal Mechanics**\n\nI\'m now analyzing the reveal mechanism\'s specifics. I\'m focusing on `uSkyReveal`\'s blending behavior during bloom and radius changes. The geometry pixel calculations incorporate distance to reveal center and 3D noise wobble for a more organic feel. The `revealMask` modulates ink sketch, which uses paper base and crisp ink outlines derived from depth and luminance discontinuities.\n\n\n**Exploring Ink Techniques**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the visual aesthetics. I\'m focusing on those ink lines, particularly the pencil cross-hatching created by luminance bands, which I\'ll implement with diagonal hatches in mid-dark and deep shadow tones. I\'ll also add a subtle paper grain effect. Then I\'ll check how to achieve that watercolor bleed tint along the reveal boundary. I will implement these techniques with a reveal radius check.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "3VEAa8fRK877xs0P8NmFkAQ"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9958912456696289025"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import * as THREE from \\\"three\\\";\\nimport { Effect, EffectAttribute } from \\\"postprocessing\\\";\\n\\nconst SKETCH_FRAGMENT = /* glsl */ `\\nuniform float uSketchAmount;\\nuniform vec3 uRevealCenter;\\nuniform float uRevealRadius;\\nuniform float uSkyReveal;\\nuniform mat4 uInvProjectionMatrix;\\nuniform mat4 uCameraMatrixWorld;\\n\\nfloat sketchHash(vec2 p) {\\n  vec3 p3 = fract(vec3(p.xyx) * 0.1031);\\n  p3 += dot(p3, p3.yzx + 33.33);\\n  return fract((p3.x + p3.y) * p3.z);\\n}\\n\\nfloat noise3(vec3 p) {\\n  vec3 i = floor(p);\\n  vec3 f = fract(p);\\n  f = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\\n  float n000 = fract(sin(dot(i, vec3(127.1, 311.7, 74.7))) * 43758.5453);\\n  float n100 = fract(sin(dot(i + vec3(1.0, 0.0, 0.0), vec3(127.1, 311.7, 74.7))) * 43758.5453);\\n  float n010 = fract(sin(dot(i + vec3(0.0, 1.0, 0.0), vec3(127.1, 311.7, 74.7))) * 43758.5453);\\n  float n110 = fract(sin(dot(i + vec3(1.0, 1.0, 0.0), vec3(127.1, 311.7, 74.7))) * 43758.5453);\\n  float n001 = fract(sin(dot(i + vec3(0.0, 0.0, 1.0), vec3(127.1, 311.7, 74.7))) * 43758.5453);\\n  float n101 = fract(sin(dot(i + vec3(1.0, 0.0, 1.0), vec3(127.1, 311.7, 74.7))) * 43758.5453);\\n  float n011 = fract(sin(dot(i + vec3(0.0, 1.0, 1.0), vec3(127.1, 311.7, 74.7))) * 43758.5453);\\n  float n111 = fract(sin(dot(i + vec3(1.0, 1.0, 1.0), vec3(127.1, 311.7, 74.7))) * 43758.5453);\\n  float nx00 = mix(n000, n100, f.x);\\n  float nx10 = mix(n010, n110, f.x);\\n  float nx01 = mix(n001, n101, f.x);\\n  float nx11 = mix(n011, n111, f.x);\\n  float nxy0 = mix(nx00, nx10, f.y);\\n  float nxy1 = mix(nx01, nx11, f.y);\\n  return mix(nxy0, nxy1, f.z);\\n}\\n\\nvec3 reconstructViewPos(vec2 uv, float d) {\\n  vec4 ndc = vec4(uv * 2.0 - 1.0, d * 2.0 - 1.0, 1.0);\\n  vec4 vp = uInvProjectionMatrix * ndc;\\n  return vp.xyz / max(vp.w, 1e-5);\\n}\\n\\nvoid mainImage(const in vec4 inputColor, const in vec2 uv, const in float depth, out vec4 outputColor) {\\n  vec3 paperCol = vec3(0.984, 0.965, 0.933); // #FBF6EE\\n  vec3 inkCol   = vec3(0.169, 0.133, 0.188); // #2B2230\\n  vec3 washCol  = vec3(1.0, 0.788, 0.839);   // #FFC9D6 soft watercolor edge\\n\\n  bool isSky = depth >= 0.9999;\\n\\n  // Rebuild world position from depth\\n  vec3 viewPos = reconstructViewPos(uv, depth);\\n  vec3 worldPos = (uCameraMatrixWorld * vec4(viewPos, 1.0)).xyz;\\n\\n  // Edge detection on depth & color luminance (~1.5px)\\n  vec2 off = texelSize * 1.45;\\n  float dL = readDepth(uv - vec2(off.x, 0.0));\\n  float dR = readDepth(uv + vec2(off.x, 0.0));\\n  float dU = readDepth(uv + vec2(0.0, off.y));\\n  float dD = readDepth(uv - vec2(0.0, off.y));\\n\\n  float zC = -viewPos.z;\\n  float zL = -reconstructViewPos(uv - vec2(off.x, 0.0), dL).z;\\n  float zR = -reconstructViewPos(uv + vec2(off.x, 0.0), dR).z;\\n  float zU = -reconstructViewPos(uv + vec2(0.0, off.y), dU).z;\\n  float zD = -reconstructViewPos(uv - vec2(0.0, off.y), dD).z;\\n\\n  // Second-order depth Laplacian catches creases and silhouettes cleanly\\n  float depthEdge = abs(zL + zR - 2.0 * zC) + abs(zU + zD - 2.0 * zC);\\n  float silEdge = max(abs(zL - zR), abs(zU - zD));\\n\\n  vec3 cL = texture2D(inputBuffer, uv - vec2(off.x, 0.0)).rgb;\\n  vec3 cR = texture2D(inputBuffer, uv + vec2(off.x, 0.0)).rgb;\\n  vec3 cU = texture2D(inputBuffer, uv + vec2(0.0, off.y)).rgb;\\n  vec3 cD = texture2D(inputBuffer, uv - vec2(0.0, off.y)).rgb;\\n  float lC = linearToRelativeLuminance(inputColor.rgb);\\n  float lDiff = max(\\n    abs(linearToRelativeLuminance(cL) - linearToRelativeLuminance(cR)),\\n    abs(linearToRelativeLuminance(cU) - linearToRelativeLuminance(cD))\\n  );\\n\\n  float edgeStrength = smoothstep(0.14, 0.45, depthEdge * 1.2 + silEdge * 0.32)\\n                     + smoothstep(0.16, 0.36, lDiff) * 0.55;\\n  edgeStrength = clamp(edgeStrength, 0.0, 1.0);\\n  if (isSky) edgeStrength = 0.0;\\n\\n  // Pencil cross-hatching by luminance bands\\n  vec2 px = uv * resolution;\\n  float wobbleLine = noise3(vec3(px * 0.03, 1.0)) * 2.0;\\n  float h1 = abs(fract((px.x + px.y + wobbleLine) * 0.14) - 0.5);\\n  float h2 = abs(fract((px.x - px.y - wobbleLine) * 0.14) - 0.5);\\n\\n  float hatch = 0.0;\\n  if (!isSky) {\\n    if (lC < 0.48) {\\n      hatch += (1.0 - smoothstep(0.04, 0.16, h1)) * 0.42;\\n    }\\n    if (lC < 0.24) {\\n      hatch += (1.0 - smoothstep(0.04, 0.16, h2)) * 0.38;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  // Subtle static paper grain\\n  float grain = (sketchHash(floor(px * 0.75)) - 0.5) * 0.045;\\n  vec3 sketchCol = paperCol + grain;\\n  sketchCol = mix(sketchCol, inkCol, clamp(hatch + edgeStrength * 0.92, 0.0, 0.96));\\n\\n  // World-space reveal sphere with noise-wobbled ~1.5-block watercolor edge\\n  float reveal = 0.0;\\n  float edgeWash = 0.0;\\n  if (isSky) {\\n    reveal = uSkyReveal;\\n  } else if (uRevealRadius > 0.05) {\\n    float n = (noise3(worldPos * 0.55) - 0.5) * 1.75;\\n    float dist = distance(worldPos, uRevealCenter) + n;\\n    reveal = 1.0 - smoothstep(uRevealRadius - 1.5, uRevealRadius + 0.35, dist);\\n    edgeWash = smoothstep(uRevealRadius - 2.2, uRevealRadius - 0.8, dist) * (1.0 - reveal);\\n  }\\n\\n  float colorMix = mix(1.0, reveal, uSketchAmount);\\n  vec3 outRgb = mix(sketchCol, inputColor.rgb, colorMix);\\n  outRgb = mix(outRgb, washCol, edgeWash * 0.38 * uSketchAmount);\\n\\n  outputColor = vec4(outRgb, inputColor.a);\\n}\\n`;\\n\\nexport class SketchEffectImpl extends Effect {\\n  private cameraRef: THREE.Camera | null = null;\\n\\n  constructor() {\\n    super(\\\"SketchEffect\\\", SKETCH_FRAGMENT, {\\n      attributes: EffectAttribute.DEPTH,\\n      uniforms: new Map<string, THREE.Uniform<unknown>>([\\n        [\\\"uSketchAmount\\\", new THREE.Uniform(1.0)],\\n        [\\\"uRevealCenter\\\", new THREE.Uniform(new THREE.Vector3(0, 0.5, 0))],\\n        [\\\"uRevealRadius\\\", new THREE.Uniform(0.0)],\\n        [\\\"uSkyReveal\\\", new THREE.Uniform(0.0)],\\n        [\\\"uInvProjectionMatrix\\\", new THREE.Uniform(new THREE.Matrix4())],\\n        [\\\"uCameraMatrixWorld\\\", new THREE.Uniform(new THREE.Matrix4())],\\n      ]),\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  setCamera(camera: THREE.Camera) {\\n    this.cameraRef = camera;\\n  }\\n\\n  setReveal(radius: number, skyReveal: number, center: THREE.Vector3, sketchAmount = 1.0) {\\n    (this.uniforms.get(\\\"uRevealRadius\\\") as THREE.Uniform<number>).value = radius;\\n    (this.uniforms.get(\\\"uSkyReveal\\\") as THREE.Uniform<number>).value = skyReveal;\\n    (this.uniforms.get(\\\"uRevealCenter\\\") as THREE.Uniform<THREE.Vector3>).value.copy(center);\\n    (this.uniforms.get(\\\"uSketchAmount\\\") as THREE.Uniform<number>).value = sketchAmount;\\n  }\\n\\n  override update() {\\n    if (!this.cameraRef) return;\\n    (this.uniforms.get(\\\"uInvProjectionMatrix\\\") as THREE.Uniform<THREE.Matrix4>).value.copy(\\n      this.cameraRef.projectionMatrixInverse,\\n    );\\n    (this.uniforms.get(\\\"uCameraMatrixWorld\\\") as THREE.Uniform<THREE.Matrix4>).value.copy(\\n      this.cameraRef.matrixWorld,\\n    );\\n  }\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create custom SketchEffect postprocessing shader with world-space watercolor reveal, ink edges, and pencil cross-hatching\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/three/effects/SketchEffect.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing custom SketchEffect shader\", \"toolSummary\":\"Write SketchEffect.ts\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\265)\n\262)\001i\024}\023*%\r\374\317\232\265&\310P\243w\343\342 \245\332@bk\312\353W\242\303vs\336\350\002\201\302/{Y,\017\312\370b5D\343\017\240z\323\335]\210\256\306\243\242H\321\344\026n@n -qf\033\272\033X*\022r\376\373\212\344\234\242L^[&D\201\253\021\3259\335\370\373\357\331\300\r\312\240e\376\225\374\304t\334D\241\360\241 \307i\371\202\324T\230\021i6\323\352\300\311u_\356\3367>=\352\314\017\275\235\323\214\032tzj\356\267<\272!\221FH/[\273\340I\204\273\356\004_\203?R\374\315(^\212K\203\247A\316:Ds:\0058\256\310\275\\\326e\354\272\256\r\342\r\274\345m\323\232\360\253d\362\355\357\v{\247\354(]-\263z\321\273\351@\035\375\316\211\347\016\227\327\001\363\000\217g\315\337\360\362A\257\215\024+1F\246\312\224\231\220i~\316L)gLjZ\016\211\207\253\353\310\373x\255\2262\035J\327\234\032\310\016\027C\256\355/<\257L\022\243\240\371\200\v\v\221\r\\\262\226 \332\277\215\363\213\200\343\231A\377sy\241\025\353\352\002Cl\277\031\224P0\337\333vZ\247\301k\253\276\313\"+\254\207=\016\263\260\253$\232\212e\317\001u\301\221GCcN\346\227yJt\020\343\262!\270\324\313u\302@d\224\252\246\347\264P\212\203\252\261\033\344&\270\377\250(\243G\235u\321\374\2539.\"\v\230 ,\221fp\270\212\221\362~ o\200C6\035\377\315n\323o\222+\257~`\016\363\024\227\340uD\202\222\256j\023+\210f`\327M\247\202\322\225\342\216\021\353\216\305\002S6\242\304P\262\372G\031\001\022\261`\3556Y\344\034\324\367\236\370\035\360\272\350 \260\272NF\320\255\034\306\232[\275\262\234sl\"\037V\211Z6\370\344\362\364jtv1\365nrc\272~\a\300`e^bnDCig\0016I\264\273\237=\315\321\ag\350\034\322<\032\r\331\370\037\f\321\344\355r;\334\271\000L\254\006\347\033\314\016\036\005\314q\360\350F\303\202\355\237\006*\212^\n\223?\270\207\315\313\211\335\370\246\207\241X\210\344\n\265\267H\000\341\210\367\371\224\373\277t\377<\324\254S\221\303\370\207\227X\004\2368\021O/\'\016,F\252SD\377K\373\337\367\021\244\224\366\230,\213F5\2324\033\'\322O~\300&\314\354\317\273?\235q \357\'M\375\351+\225\"\236f\253#QB\337\217\025m\