  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Core Request**: Build the complete frontend marketing website for **Petalnode**, a Minecraft server hosting brand, following the 5 attached specification files saved under `/public/assets/aistudio/`:\n  - `01-MASTER-BRIEF_0a361ce6.md` (intent, stack, non-negotiables, architecture rules, Definition of Done)\n  - `02-ART-DIRECTION_fa4a3067.md` (color tokens, 5 Google Fonts, sketch kit, motion language, 3D shader look, 64\303\22764 procedural block textures, world-space `SketchEffect`, quality tiers, anti-slop checklist)\n  - `03-STORYBOARD_b7eaa2a6.md` (single source of truth for all copy, TODO markers, 6-chapter scroll story, plans, FAQ, nav, footer additive edits, static fallback, 404, SEO)\n  - `04-BUILD-PHASES_0232a9d0.md` (13 build tasks & verification checks)\n  - `doodle-crew-footer_649c2b97.tsx` (owner\'s footer component, copied byte-for-byte then given 4 additive edits)\n- **Pages & Routes**:\n  - `/` (Home): Hero + 6-chapter pinned scrubbed 3D scroll story (Seed \342\206\222 Roots \342\206\222 Shield \342\206\222 Instant Build \342\206\222 Neighbors \342\206\222 Bloom) + Bloom snapshot polaroid + Plans highlight (Sprout, Sapling [OUR PICK], Blossom) + Trust strip + FAQ accordion + Final CTA + DoodleCrewFooter.\n  - `/plans` (Plans): Header + 6-tier PlanGrid + notebook-paper CompareTable + FAQ subset (`[2, 3, 5, 6, 8]`) + DoodleCrewFooter.\n  - `/*` (404): Nodey + wilted sapling + \"This page didn\'t sprout.\" + \"Back home\".\n  - Dev-only routes (`import.meta.env.DEV`): `/dev/sketch` and `/dev/textures`.\n- **Scope Boundaries & Non-Negotiables**:\n  - Frontend-only static site; all purchase/CTA links point to URLs in `src/content/index.ts` (Paymenter URLs remain `TODO` until owner fills them in; zero backend/auth/DB).\n  - Zero Mojang assets/vanilla textures/logos; zero invented facts (keep `TODO`s exact); zero forbidden AI-slop words (`unleash, elevate, seamless, next-level, cutting-edge, supercharge, revolutionize, empower`), zero purple/glassmorphism/emoji icons; `lucide-react` ONLY for `menu, close, chevron, external-link, check`.\n  - All story copy in real DOM; story is a reversible pure function of `storyStore.progress` (no React re-render per scroll frame).\n  - Graceful static fallback (`StoryStatic`) for `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`, no-WebGL, `?static=1`, or WebGL context loss.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Skills & References Already Read (DO NOT re-read unless evicted from context):\n- `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md` & `references/games_3d.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md` & `references/2_landing_marketing.md`, `references/5_threejs_3d_spatial.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/threejs/SKILL.md` & `references/fundamentals.md`, `geometry.md`, `materials.md`, `textures.md`, `shaders.md`, `postprocessing.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/computer_use/SKILL.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/applet_seo/SKILL.md`\n\n### Completed Files & Verified State:\n- **Packages & Project Config**:\n  - Single batched `install_applet_package` completed: `gsap@^3.15.1`, `@gsap/react`, `lenis`, `three@^0.187.0`, `@types/three`, `@react-three/fiber@^9.8.2`, `@react-three/drei@^10.7.9`, `@react-three/postprocessing@^3.2.2`, `postprocessing@^6.39.6`, `n8ao`, `roughjs`, `react-router-dom@^7.18.6`, `clsx`, `tailwind-merge`, `@radix-ui/react-accordion`, `@radix-ui/react-dialog`.\n  - `/package.json`: added `\"check:release\": \"tsx scripts/check-release.ts\"`.\n  - `/metadata.json`: set name `\"Petalnode\"` and description.\n  - `/index.html`: configured SEO meta, OpenGraph, Twitter tags, and Google Fonts (`Bricolage Grotesque`, `Fraunces`, `Nunito`, `Pixelify Sans`, `Shantell Sans`).\n  - `/tsconfig.json` & `/vite.config.ts`: `@/*` / `@` alias points to `./src/*` / `src`.\n  - `/src/index.css`: Tailwind v4 `@theme` + `:root` color tokens (`paper`, `paper-shade`, `paper-line`, `ink`, `ink-soft`, `blossom-50/200/400/600`, `moss`, `bark`, `lantern`, `sky-*`, `alert`), font utilities, `.sticker-btn`, `.notebook-ruled`, `.paper-surface`, `.stamp-animate`.\n- **Content & Release Script**:\n  - `/src/content/index.ts`: complete content module from `03-STORYBOARD.md` + `isTodo()`, `listTodos()`.\n  - `/scripts/check-release.ts`: lists all TODOs and exits 1 when any URL is still TODO.\n- **Core Pure Modules**:\n  - `/src/lib/utils.ts` (`cn`)\n  - `/src/lib/gsap.ts` (registers `ScrollTrigger`, `SplitText`, `DrawSVGPlugin`, `useGSAP` once)\n  - `/src/lib/quality.ts` (`pickInitialTier`, `stepDownTier`, `isSoftwareGlRenderer`, `detectBrowserSignals`)\n  - `/src/lib/storyStore.ts` (`storyStore`, `CHAPTER_RANGES`, `chapterAt`, `chapterStart`, `chapterProgress`, `revealRadiusFor`)\n  - `/src/lib/roughPaths.ts` (deterministic `rough.generator()` SVG paths)\n- **Providers & UI Primitives**:\n  - `/src/app/QualityProvider.tsx` (`QualityProvider`, `useQualityTier`, `useReducedMotion`)\n  - `/src/app/SmoothScroll.tsx` (`SmoothScrollProvider` driving `ReactLenis` via `gsap.ticker`, `lagSmoothing(0)`, disabled in static/reduced-motion)\n  - `/src/components/ui/accordion.tsx` (folded-note Radix Accordion)\n  - `/src/components/ui/sheet.tsx` (ruled-notebook Radix Sheet)\n  - `/src/components/ui/doodle-crew-footer.tsx` (copied byte-for-byte from attachment `diff` = 0, then applied ONLY the 4 additive edits: `nodey` & `sapling` crew kinds, `petal` & `cube` doodles, optional `logo` prop).\n- **Sketch Kit (`/src/components/sketch/`)**:\n  - `LineBoilFilters.tsx`, `PaperBackground.tsx`, `RoughBox.tsx`, `RoughHighlight.tsx` (`RoughUnderline`, `RoughCircle`), `InkArrow.tsx`, `WashiTape.tsx`, `PolaroidFrame.tsx`, `Stamp.tsx`, `HandIcon.tsx` (all 15 icons), `Mascots.tsx` (`Nodey`, `Sprout`), `StickerButton.tsx`, `index.ts`.\n- **Layout Chrome (`/src/components/layout/`)**:\n  - `Nav.tsx`, `DevTodoBadge.tsx`, `PageShell.tsx`.\n- **3D Island, Textures & Scene (`/src/three/`)**:\n  - `/src/three/island/islandGenerator.ts` (deterministic ~4,600 blocks at size 1, ~60% at size 0.6, zero duplicates, ordered Roots, coherent Build structure groups, named anchors `seed`, `ore`, `domeRim`, `house`, `mascots`)\n  - `/src/three/island/textures.ts` (deterministic 64\303\22764 RGBA albedo/normal/emissive buffers for all 14 block/plant types + GPU `onBeforeCompile` drop-in, cutaway clip, dusk boost, leaf wind sway)\n  - `/src/three/effects/SketchEffect.ts` & `PostFX.tsx` (world-space reveal sphere + depth/luminance ink outlines + 2-band cross-hatching + watercolor edge wash; tiered `N8AO`/`Bloom`/`DOF`/`ACESFilmic`/`Vignette` + `isSoftwareGl` safe path)\n  - `/src/three/island/IslandBlocks.tsx`, `/src/three/story/StorySetPieces.tsx`, `/src/three/story/CameraRig.tsx`, `/src/three/IslandCanvas.tsx` (all written; **not yet compiled with `tsc`/`vite` or tested in browser**).\n- **Unit Tests Passing (31/31)**:\n  - Ran `npx --yes tsx --test src/content/content.test.ts src/lib/quality.test.ts src/lib/storyStore.test.ts src/lib/roughPaths.test.ts src/three/island/islandGenerator.test.ts src/three/island/textures.test.ts src/components/ui/doodle-crew-footer.test.ts` -> **31 pass, 0 fail**.\n  - Note: Re-run `doodle-crew-footer.test.ts` after the additive edits if desired (edits were applied right before writing the next batch).\n  - Ran `npm run check:release`: listed 76 TODO items (33 URL TODOs, 43 fact TODOs) and exited non-zero as expected.\n\n### Not Yet Built:\n- Story illustrations (`SeedSketchSvg`, `IslandSketchSvg` 6-layer SVG), Home sections (`Hero`/`Story`, `ChapterCard`, `StoryVine`, `AnnotationOverlay`, `PanelSketch`, `StoryStatic`, `PlansHighlight`, `TrustStrip`, `FAQ`, `FinalCTA`), Plans sections (`PlanCard`, `PlanGrid`, `CompareTable`), Pages (`Home`, `Plans`, `NotFound`, dev `/dev/sketch` & `/dev/textures`), Router/App wiring (`src/App.tsx`).\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- `postprocessing` v6 (`EffectAttribute.DEPTH`) passes `depth` directly to `mainImage(const in vec4 inputColor, const in vec2 uv, const in float depth, out vec4 outputColor)` and provides `readDepth(uv)`, `texelSize`, `resolution`, `linearToRelativeLuminance`.\n- `tsx` v4 resolves `@/*` from `tsconfig.json` seamlessly during `npx --yes tsx --test`.\n- Headless Chromium in this container uses CPU SwiftShader (`isSoftwareGl = true`). `IslandCanvas.tsx` already implements `frameloop=\"demand\"` + `gl.fenceSync` paced `invalidate()` + skips `N8AO`/`DOF`/`Bloom` multi-pass overhead when `isSoftwareGl` is true so `playwright-cli` captures never stall.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n1. `cherry_leaves` transparent pixel percentage was `13.9%` vs required `15\342\200\22335%` in `textures.test.ts`: raised cluster cutout threshold from `0.37` to `0.42` in `src/three/island/textures.ts`. Fixed & verified passing.\n2. `scripts/check-release.ts` initially imported `../content/index` instead of `../src/content/index`: fixed path. Verified working.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Working directory: `/app/applet`. All file paths for file tools start with `/`.\n- Build/dev server has NOT been compiled or started yet since code writes are still underway (deferred verification per agent instructions).\n- Remember React Router SPA routing (`BrowserRouter` in `src/App.tsx` with `/`, `/plans`, `*` -> `NotFound`, plus dev-only `/dev/sketch` and `/dev/textures`), and scroll-to-top on route change + `ScrollTrigger.refresh()` discipline on mount/route/font load/canvas mount.\n\n## 6. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. **Create SVG Island Illustrations (`src/components/sketch/IslandIllustrations.tsx`)**:\n   - `SeedSketchSvg`: hand-drawn SVG of the single grass block + sapling for the hero before the lazy `IslandCanvas` mounts (crossfades out when canvas `onReady` fires).\n   - `IslandSketchSvg({ stage })`: 1 layered SVG with cumulative layers for stages `0..5` (`seed`, `roots`, `shield`, `build`, `neighbors`, `bloom`). Stages `0..2` ink-only; stages `3..5` add flat watercolor fills (`moss`, `blossom-200/400`, `bark`, `lantern`, `sky-dusk` backdrop in stage 4/5).\n2. **Create Plans & Shared Sections**:\n   - `src/sections/plans/PlanCard.tsx`: `variant: \"compact\" | \"full\"`, growth illustration (seed \342\206\222 orchard across the 6 tiers), RAM in big Pixelify digits, cardLine, specs (`CPU`, `Storage`, `Good for`), `$\342\200\224 /mo` + `Stamp(\"TODO\")` when `isTodo(priceMonthly)`, `Stamp(\"OUR PICK\")` ONLY on `sapling`, `StickerButton` `\"Plant this server \342\206\222\"` with `href={plan.paymenterUrl}`.\n   - `src/sections/plans/PlanGrid.tsx` & `src/sections/plans/CompareTable.tsx` (ruled notebook paper, sticky first column, horizontal swipe on mobile, rows: RAM, CPU, Storage, Good for, DDoS protection, Backups, Price, CTA button).\n   - `src/sections/home/PlansHighlight.tsx`: renders `sprout`, `sapling`, `blossom` in order (`sapling` slightly larger/straighter in middle), displays the frozen Bloom polaroid image (`storyStore.snapshotDataUrl` or colored SVG fallback if jumped past before snapshot) on the right (desktop) / between sub and cards (mobile), plus `\"See all six plans \342\206\222\"` link to `/plans`.\n   - `src/sections/home/TrustStrip.tsx`: `\"The boring stuff, done right.\"` with 4 varied-rotation hand-drawn items (`Uptime`, `Locations` with tiny hand-drawn map+pins, `Pay your way`, `Backups`); reviews slot renders NOTHING in production when `trust.reviews` is empty, and a dashed box in `import.meta.env.DEV` (`trust.reviewsTodoNotice`).\n   - `src/sections/home/FAQ.tsx`: accepts optional `filterIds?: number[]`, renders folded-note `Accordion`.\n   - `src/sections/home/FinalCTA.tsx`: `Nodey` holding sapling + `RoughBox` + heading + `Get a server` & `Join the Discord`.\n3. **Create Interactive Story & Static Story Sections (`src/sections/home/`)**:\n   - `PanelSketch.tsx`: hand-drawn mini panel `RoughBox` (`TODO: panel name`) with buttons `Paper \302\267 Fabric \302\267 Forge \302\267 NeoForge \302\267 Modpacks`, hand-drawn cursor clicking `Modpacks`, and mini progress bar driven strictly by scrubbed `chapterProgress(p, \'build\')` (no React state per frame \342\200\224 update DOM style/transform via refs!).\n   - `ChapterCard.tsx`: `RoughBox` on `paper-shade` with `WashiTape` corner, max-w-[420px], alternating left/right on desktop, bottom 42% on mobile.\n   - `StoryVine.tsx`: desktop right-edge thin hand-drawn vine with 6 leaf nodes (`Seed..Bloom`), SVG stroke grows with `progress`, active chapter leaf turns pink (`blossom-600`), clicking leaf calls `scrollToStoryProgress(chapterStart(id))`.\n   - `Story.tsx`:\n     - Combines Hero (`0.00\342\200\2230.10`) + pinned 600vh (450vh when `startingTier === \'low\'`) section (`id=\"story\"`) containing lazy-loaded `<IslandCanvas />` (with `SeedSketchSvg` crossfade), `ChapterCard`s scrubbed by ONE master GSAP ScrollTrigger (`id: \"petalnode-story\"`, `scrub: 1`, `pin: true`) that writes `storyStore.progress`, updates vine/cards/annotations/panel cursor directly via GSAP/refs (zero React re-renders during scroll!), and performs the Bloom polaroid shrink/capture handoff cleanly.\n     - Hero intro (`SplitText` by words, `RoughUnderline` draw-in) plays once on mount (outside the scrubbed progress timeline).\n     - Calls `ScrollTrigger.refresh()` after `document.fonts.ready` and after `IslandCanvas` mounts; ensures `useGSAP` with `scope` kills all triggers on unmount so route-hopping (`Home -> Plans -> Back -> Home`) leaves zero stale spacers.\n     - If `tier === \'static\' || reducedMotion`, renders `StoryStatic.tsx` instead (supports seamless mid-scroll swap on WebGL context loss!).\n   - `StoryStatic.tsx`: 6 stacked sections in order with full DOM copy, `IslandSketchSvg` per stage (Bloom inside `PolaroidFrame`), static annotations with `InkArrow`s.\n4. **Create Pages & App Wiring**:\n   - `src/pages/Home.tsx`, `src/pages/Plans.tsx`, `src/pages/NotFound.tsx`.\n   - Dev-only `/dev/sketch` (`src/pages/DevSketch.tsx`) and `/dev/textures` (`src/pages/DevTextures.tsx`).\n   - `src/App.tsx`: `QualityProvider` -> `BrowserRouter` -> `SmoothScrollProvider` -> `PageShell` -> `Routes` (plus `ScrollToTop` / `#roots` hash handler + route-change `ScrollTrigger.refresh()`).\n   - Add DOM & component unit tests (e.g., `PlanCard`/content filtering/footer `nodey` & `sapling` & `logo` compatibility tests using React `renderToStaticMarkup` or `node:test`) to verify Task 11 & Task 12 assertions.\n5. **Verification & Ultra Mode Audit**:\n   - Re-run all `npx --yes tsx --test ...` unit tests (including `doodle-crew-footer.test.ts` + new section/component tests).\n   - Run `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` in parallel; fix any TypeScript/Vite/build issues (also verify lazy 3D chunk size and absence of `TODO \303\227 N` badge / forbidden words in `dist/` build output).\n   - Restart dev server (`restart_dev_server`) and run **browser verification with `playwright-cli`** (with `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`):\n     - Desktop `1440\303\227900`: screenshot Home hero, scroll into Story chapters (Roots cutaway, Shield dome, Build panel, Neighbors dusk, Bloom polaroid), verify `PlansHighlight`, `TrustStrip`, `FAQ` accordion click, `DoodleCrewFooter` crew click speech bubble, navigate to `/plans` (verify 6 cards + CompareTable + FAQ subset), navigate back to `/` (verify no broken pin spacer), test `/nonexistent` 404, test `/?static=1` (`StoryStatic`).\n     - Mobile `390\303\227844`: verify mobile hamburger notebook Sheet opens, story mobile split (`58%` canvas / `42%` card) or static stack, CompareTable horizontal swipe with sticky first column, no horizontal overflow.\n     - Check `playwright-cli console` for zero fatal JS/WebGL/shader errors.\n   - Critique top defects if any, fix with targeted edits, re-run unit tests + `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` + verification round 2 (max 2 browser rounds), close browser, and provide concise summary.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- No invented facts, metrics, hardware models, prices, or reviews \342\200\224 keep all `TODO`s exact.\n- No Mojang asset