  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Story Components**\n\nI\'m currently focused on clearly defining the story components. I\'ve sketched out the initial file structure, including `PanelSketch`, `ChapterCard`, `StoryVine`, and `StoryStatic` for the home section, and now I\'m designing `Story.tsx` itself.\n\n\n**Analyzing Story Scroll Mechanics**\n\nI\'m now deeply immersed in the scroll mechanics within `Story.tsx`. I\'m meticulously tracing the logic, especially how `startingTierRef` influences pin scroll distance. I see the use of `useGSAP` to create a master `ScrollTrigger`, with its intricate configuration for pinning, scrubbing, and precise start/end positions. The `invalidateOnRefresh` and `onUpdate` functions are key for responsive behavior. My focus is ensuring rock-solid scroll scrubbing and zero React state updates.\n\n\n**Implementing DOM Updates**\n\nI\'m now detailing `storyStore.progress`, integrating it with `applyProgressToDom`. This involves a one-time hero intro animation using `SplitText` with `y` and opacity staggering. I\'m focusing on zero React re-renders via imperative DOM manipulation and `ScrollTrigger.refresh()` after fonts are ready and the canvas is ready. Specifically, I\'m working on the hero overlay visibility and fade-out behavior based on progress, and the smooth chapter card entrance/exit animations driven by start/end progress values. The goal is to provide a clean scroll experience.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Transitions**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the precise timing and visual transitions of story elements. I\'m fine-tuning the `PanelSketch` behavior, particularly the cursor interaction and progress bar filling, focusing on the `Modpacks` chip. I\'ve also refined the `StoryVine`\'s SVG stroke growth and active node switching. Furthermore, I\'m working on the Polaroid transition and bloom effects\' timing, with specific start and end points for scaling, translation, rotation, and opacity changes.\n\n\n**Implementing Annotation Overlay**\n\nI\'m now implementing the live projected annotation overlay within the `AnnotationOverlay` component. The `CameraRig` is calling `onProjectAnchors`, and I\'m updating the annotation elements (`seed`, `ore`, etc.) in `Story.tsx` by passing an imperative ref handler to `<IslandCanvas>`. I\'m using `storyStore.progress` to determine the active chapter and showing annotations only when both the chapter is active and the anchor is visible. I\'m carefully positioning the labels with offsets and drawing SVG arrow lines to precisely align with the 3D anchors, clamping values for safety.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "v1IAa_mfMbGWvdIPgsSfcA"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_16749954925589323979"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import * as React from \\\"react\\\";\\nimport { isTodo, story } from \\\"@/content\\\";\\nimport { RoughBox, Stamp } from \\\"@/components/sketch\\\";\\nimport { cn } from \\\"@/lib/utils\\\";\\n\\nconst BUILD_CHAPTER = story.chapters.find((c) => c.id === \\\"build\\\")!;\\nconst LOADERS = BUILD_CHAPTER.panelLoaders ?? [\\n  \\\"Paper\\\",\\n  \\\"Fabric\\\",\\n  \\\"Forge\\\",\\n  \\\"NeoForge\\\",\\n  \\\"Modpacks\\\",\\n];\\nconst PANEL_NAME = BUILD_CHAPTER.panelName ?? \\\"TODO: panel name\\\";\\n\\n/**\\n * Pure imperative DOM updater so the scrubbed ScrollTrigger timeline drives the\\n * panel cursor click + progress bar with zero React re-renders per frame.\\n */\\nexport function updatePanelSketchDOM(\\n  root: HTMLElement | null,\\n  localProgress: number,\\n) {\\n  if (!root) return;\\n  const t = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, localProgress));\\n\\n  const cursor = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(\\\"[data-panel-cursor]\\\");\\n  const modpacksBtn = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(\'[data-loader=\\\"Modpacks\\\"]\');\\n  const progressFill = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(\\\"[data-panel-progress]\\\");\\n  const statusEl = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(\\\"[data-panel-status]\\\");\\n\\n  // Cursor moves toward Modpacks (0..0.34), presses (0.34..0.42), rests\\n  if (cursor) {\\n    const moveT = Math.min(1, t / 0.34);\\n    const easedMove = 1 - Math.pow(1 - moveT, 2);\\n    const startX = -110;\\n    const startY = 28;\\n    const x = startX * (1 - easedMove);\\n    const y = startY * (1 - easedMove);\\n    const pressScale = t >= 0.33 && t <= 0.44 ? 0.84 : 1;\\n    cursor.style.transform = `translate3d(${x.toFixed(1)}px, ${y.toFixed(1)}px, 0) scale(${pressScale})`;\\n    cursor.style.opacity = t > 0.02 ? \\\"1\\\" : \\\"0.4\\\";\\n  }\\n\\n  // Modpacks button highlights once clicked\\n  const clicked = t >= 0.36;\\n  if (modpacksBtn) {\\n    modpacksBtn.dataset.active = clicked ? \\\"true\\\" : \\\"false\\\";\\n    modpacksBtn.style.backgroundColor = clicked ? \\\"#E2557B\\\" : \\\"#FBF6EE\\\";\\n    modpacksBtn.style.color = clicked ? \\\"#FFFFFF\\\" : \\\"#2B2230\\\";\\n  }\\n\\n  // Progress bar fills 0..100% over t = 0.38..0.90\\n  const barT = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (t - 0.38) / 0.52));\\n  if (progressFill) {\\n    progressFill.style.width = `${(barT * 100).toFixed(1)}%`;\\n  }\\n  if (statusEl) {\\n    statusEl.textContent =\\n      barT >= 0.98\\n        ? \\\"Ready to join!\\\"\\n        : clicked\\n          ? \\\"Installing modpack\342\200\246\\\"\\n          : \\\"Pick a loader\\\";\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport function PanelSketch({\\n  staticComplete = false,\\n  className,\\n}: {\\n  staticComplete?: boolean;\\n  className?: string;\\n}) {\\n  const panelRef = React.useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n\\n  React.useEffect(() => {\\n    if (staticComplete) {\\n      updatePanelSketchDOM(panelRef.current, 1);\\n    } else {\\n      updatePanelSketchDOM(panelRef.current, 0);\\n    }\\n  }, [staticComplete]);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div ref={panelRef} data-panel-sketch className={cn(\\\"mt-4\\\", className)}>\\n      <RoughBox\\n        seed={407}\\n        bgClassName=\\\"bg-paper\\\"\\n        padding=\\\"p-3.5\\\"\\n        strokeWidth={1.6}\\n        className=\\\"shadow-[2px_3px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\"\\n      >\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-2 mb-2.5 border-b border-dashed border-paper-line\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"font-handwriting text-xs font-bold text-ink-soft\\\">\\n            {PANEL_NAME}\\n          </span>\\n          {isTodo(PANEL_NAME) && <Stamp text=\\\"TODO\\\" rotation={-3} size=\\\"sm\\\" />}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Loader chips */}\\n        <div className=\\\"relative flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\">\\n          {LOADERS.map((loader) => {\\n            const isModpacks = loader === \\\"Modpacks\\\";\\n            return (\\n              <span\\n                key={loader}\\n                data-loader={loader}\\n                data-active={staticComplete && isModpacks ? \\\"true\\\" : \\\"false\\\"}\\n                className={cn(\\n                  \\\"relative inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold border border-ink rounded-[2px] transition-colors\\\",\\n                  staticComplete && isModpacks\\n                    ? \\\"bg-blossom-600 text-white\\\"\\n                    : \\\"bg-paper text-ink\\\",\\n                )}\\n              >\\n                {loader}\\n                {isModpacks && (\\n                  <svg\\n                    data-panel-cursor\\n                    viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"\\n                    width={18}\\n                    height={18}\\n                    aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-3 -right-2.5 z-20 drop-shadow-[1px_1px_0_#FBF6EE]\\\"\\n                    style={{\\n                      transform: staticComplete\\n                        ? \\\"translate3d(0,0,0) scale(1)\\\"\\n                        : \\\"translate3d(-110px,28px,0) scale(1)\\\",\\n                    }}\\n                  >\\n                    <path\\n                      d=\\\"M3 2 L16 9 L10 11 L13 17 L10 18 L7 12 L3 15 Z\\\"\\n                      fill=\\\"#FFC75A\\\"\\n                      stroke=\\\"#2B2230\\\"\\n                      strokeWidth=\\\"1.6\\\"\\n                      strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\"\\n                    />\\n                  </svg>\\n                )}\\n              </span>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Progress bar */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-handwriting text-ink-soft mb-1\\\">\\n            <span data-panel-status>\\n              {staticComplete ? \\\"Ready to join!\\\" : \\\"Pick a loader\\\"}\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"h-2.5 w-full rounded-[2px] border border-ink bg-paper-shade overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            <div\\n              data-panel-progress\\n              className=\\\"h-full bg-moss transition-none\\\"\\n              style={{ width: staticComplete ? \\\"100%\\\" : \\\"0%\\\" }}\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </RoughBox>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create hand-drawn PanelSketch with imperative cursor and progress bar updater for scrubbed Build chapter\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/sections/home/PanelSketch.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating PanelSketch component\", \"toolSummary\":\"PanelSketch component creation\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\372,\n\367,\001i\024}\023\216\004\266\333\223\326I\354\032\004SF\353\233\027()\300\366<~\373d\354\261\257\232\302\272\aMa\276)a\324x\275<\345\343\367\b\225\216\264\345o\317\333\255\337,e_%u\222\020\034\a:\203\177\212\031\246\213\312u\b\bK\242%&#5\232{\311~\256\022\352`wf\203\021105?a\254\254\215\240\327\266\250N\302\f[{\\\223C\3109\205\332\254NO\232\367\031\301\2371Yfc#\316\002\001f\232:\237\203f,c[\266\355b\271Q\301\363\355A\343\325\326E\324<\367\344\222[\222\0055R\210c\b\272\375/\"\210\252_3\240\037\265\265\363\276\323n\221js,\263$N\276qM\303\036X>\001\003!\216C&\254\\\300\203\201\313\305\340C>\030\235\3271rY!P\333M\317\322\301\213\200Z\004\246 \333\305\244\371Ti~\213N\230\317\tL\373\325Rv\313:\312\037\027E\2020<P{\337\212\372F*\200\374\035\374\327\355\207\300\230\025c.gN\033\220C\340\227V\004u;\035\024\226/N\f\tR\351\032\037\250\227\3326\202W\332\355\316\367\305\365\245 \374\237\v\216\346\247\366\0260\264\336#g\214z\021\366\223\333\315\033\237/*\373.\313\270\323\334\323N\337\306\032B\030st\301E\241|p-\037\nl\274X\177\274\260<(ilju\235\a\242#\335L-\242\345\023\274w\017R\372\3675\ag\357\004&W^\024\265\317<\315\034Z<\f\330\025\002\365T\236 j^\006C\f\n\354\305\257s\220\357c\376\377\032\026\261\203\216\004\216NE\325\005\023)\221\263\217\224\\K\3647E\377u\240;?\344\363zp\n\333\2325\237\260\323\027X\224\026~\256!m\356}\002.\022\375\344\036/\221\213\312.\261\217\263m&\256\r(\003-{\017#\027\237\364\001\263i\253\235v$\314\264\033\257R\363ew\2308\230\222\224\276N\244\277\003\256^\244\034l\305\3573\024\265\027\204\323\206\221\231\340AvJL\241{\316\245X\341\303 \004Jl\377\365T\372_\320:\n[\307@o\331\236\240\275\232i-\257\333,\030\273k$\276\272\221V\032\242]\v*\252\003\307\253\306\362\225_A\243\244>e\335\360\233\331\255{\v\273=\201%\b\002\244H\326\263\264|w\312\005yh\340\02255\005\227i\262\261K\353\230J\357\n\\\313\361\2574\305\205\273k\211\2621\232z\330s\313\236\002]L\233\005F<%:;\343(\254{\342\343\256\247\277\226\231irs\256\301fU\017R\224\31291