  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Investigating a Bug**\n\nI\'m currently trying to understand why \"TODO \303\227\" is still showing up in the `dist` directory. I ran `grep` to look for its presence and it\'s strange. I\'m focusing on why `import.meta.env && import.meta.env.DEV` wasn\'t stripped from `PageShell`.\n\n\n**Refining the Approach**\n\nI\'ve realized that the issue might stem from how Vite/Rolldown handle `import.meta.env`. Specifically, the conditional `import.meta.env && import.meta.env.DEV` might not be consistently constant-folded. This leads me to believe a lazy-loading approach for `DevTodoBadge` within `PageShell.tsx` might be the solution, as seen with `DevSketchLazy`. I\'m comparing this to what happened in `App.tsx` and considering the import paths.\n\n\n"
