  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Observing Visuals Emerge**\n\nI\'m incredibly excited about the new visuals! The `home-hero.png` mockup showcases a real ink sketch and pencil cross-hatching, creating a tangible feel for the seed block and sapling on cream paper. The typography is clean, with a SplitText headline and a wavy pink `RoughUnderline` on \"world\". The `StoryVine` element on the right is a fantastic touch!\n\n\n**Visualizing Further Developments**\n\nMy mind is racing with these new visuals! I\'ve fleshed out the underground scene with glowing ore veins, labeled as the CPU, cutaway below the colored seed block. The story shield now features a radial surface reveal with watercolor edge and hexagon dome. The `story-build.png` shows a full-color aerial view as a `PanelSketch` cursor clicks \'Modpacks\'. I\'m also thrilled with the porch scene, and the shrinking island in the Polaroid frame! The `OUR PICK` stamp on `home-plans.png` is clean. I even caught one tiny detail on the `story-shield.png`.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "N1YAa_WSH4b6xs0PjvGzEQ"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5505916007171366457"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"bash -c \'\\nset -euo pipefail\\ntrap \\\"playwright-cli close >/dev/null 2>&1 || true\\\" EXIT\\n\\nplaywright-cli open \\\"http://localhost:3000/plans\\\"\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900\\nsleep 1.2\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async page => { await page.screenshot({ path: \\\\\\\".playwright-verify/plans-desktop.png\\\\\\\", animations: \\\\\\\"disabled\\\\\\\" }); }\\\"\\nplaywright-cli eval \\\"({ cardCount: document.querySelectorAll(\\\\\\\"[data-plan-id]\\\\\\\").length, ourPickCount: Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\\\\\\\"[data-plan-id]\\\\\\\")).filter(el => el.innerText.includes(\\\\\\\"OUR PICK\\\\\\\")).length, overflow: document.documentElement.scrollWidth > window.innerWidth, faqCount: document.querySelectorAll(\\\\\\\"[data-radix-collection-item]\\\\\\\").length })\\\"\\n\\n# Route hopping Home -> Plans -> Back -> Home\\nplaywright-cli goto \\\"http://localhost:3000/\\\"\\nsleep 1.2\\nplaywright-cli goto \\\"http://localhost:3000/plans\\\"\\nsleep 0.8\\nplaywright-cli go-back\\nsleep 1.2\\nplaywright-cli eval \\\"({ path: location.pathname, pinSpacers: document.querySelectorAll(\\\\\\\".pin-spacer\\\\\\\").length, scrollY: window.scrollY, hasCanvas: !!document.querySelector(\\\\\\\"canvas\\\\\\\") })\\\"\\n\\n# 404 check\\nplaywright-cli goto \\\"http://localhost:3000/missing-page\\\"\\nsleep 0.8\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async page => { await page.screenshot({ path: \\\\\\\".playwright-verify/not-found.png\\\\\\\", animations: \\\\\\\"disabled\\\\\\\" }); }\\\"\\nplaywright-cli eval \\\"({ heading: document.querySelector(\\\\\\\"h1\\\\\\\")?.textContent, homeHref: document.querySelector(\\\\\\\"main a[href=\\\\\\\\\\\"/\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\")?.getAttribute(\\\\\\\"href\\\\\\\") })\\\"\\n\\n# Static fallback check\\nplaywright-cli goto \\\"http://localhost:3000/?static=1\\\"\\nsleep 0.8\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async page => { await page.screenshot({ path: \\\\\\\".playwright-verify/home-static.png\\\\\\\", animations: \\\\\\\"disabled\\\\\\\" }); }\\\"\\nplaywright-cli eval \\\"({ mode: document.getElementById(\\\\\\\"story\\\\\\\")?.dataset.storyMode, canvases: document.querySelectorAll(\\\\\\\"canvas\\\\\\\").length, chapterHeadings: Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\\\\\\\"#story h1, #story h2\\\\\\\")).map(h => h.textContent) })\\\"\\n\\n# Mobile 390x844 (static=1 vs interactive)\\nplaywright-cli goto \\\"http://localhost:3000/\\\"\\nplaywright-cli resize 390 844\\nsleep 2.2\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async page => { await page.screenshot({ path: \\\\\\\".playwright-verify/mobile-hero.png\\\\\\\", animations: \\\\\\\"disabled\\\\\\\" }); }\\\"\\nplaywright-cli eval \\\"({ overflow: document.documentElement.scrollWidth > window.innerWidth })\\\"\\nplaywright-cli eval \\\"document.querySelector(\\\\\\\"button[aria-label=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Open menu\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\")?.click()\\\"\\nsleep 0.5\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async page => { await page.screenshot({ path: \\\\\\\".playwright-verify/mobile-menu.png\\\\\\\", animations: \\\\\\\"disabled\\\\\\\" }); }\\\"\\n\\nplaywright-cli goto \\\"http://localhost:3000/plans\\\"\\nsleep 0.8\\nplaywright-cli eval \\\"({ mobilePlansOverflow: document.documentElement.scrollWidth > window.innerWidth, stickyCol: getComputedStyle(document.querySelector(\\\\\\\"table th\\\\\\\")).position })\\\"\\n\\nplaywright-cli console error\\n\'\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Testing Plans, routing, 404, static, and mobile views\", \"toolSummary\":\"Remaining routes & mobile check\"}"
