  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 1
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Core Request**: Build the complete frontend marketing website for **Petalnode**, a Minecraft server hosting brand, following the 5 specification files under `/public/assets/aistudio/` (`01-MASTER-BRIEF_0a361ce6.md`, `02-ART-DIRECTION_fa4a3067.md`, `03-STORYBOARD_b7eaa2a6.md`, `04-BUILD-PHASES_0232a9d0.md`, `doodle-crew-footer_649c2b97.tsx`).\n- **Routes**:\n  - `/` (`Home`): Hero + 6-chapter pinned scrubbed 3D scroll story (`Seed -> Roots -> Shield -> Instant Build -> Neighbors -> Bloom`) + `PlansHighlight` (frozen Bloom snapshot polaroid + `Sprout`, `Sapling` [OUR PICK], `Blossom`) + `TrustStrip` + `FAQ` + `FinalCTA` + `DoodleCrewFooter`.\n  - `/plans` (`Plans`): Header + 6-tier `PlanGrid` + notebook-paper `CompareTable` + `FAQ` subset (`[2, 3, 5, 6, 8]`) + `DoodleCrewFooter`.\n  - `/*` (`NotFound`): Nodey + wilted Sprout + `\"This page didn\'t sprout.\"` + `\"Back home\"`.\n  - Dev-only routes (`import.meta.env.DEV`): `/dev/sketch`, `/dev/textures`.\n- **Non-Negotiables**:\n  - Frontend-only; keep all `TODO`s exact; no invented facts, prices, specs, or reviews; no Mojang assets/vanilla textures; no forbidden AI-slop words; `lucide-react` ONLY for `menu, close, chevron, external-link, check`; `DevTodoBadge` & dev routes stripped from production bundle.\n  - Pure reversible story function of `storyStore.progress` with zero React re-renders per scroll frame, plus `StoryStatic` fallback (`?static=1`, reduced motion, no-WebGL, context loss).\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Skills Already Read (DO NOT re-read unless evicted):\n- `ultra-mode`, `frontend-design`, `threejs`, `computer-use`, `applet-seo`.\n\n### Completed Code & Verified State:\n- **Packages & Config**: All packages installed (`gsap`, `@gsap/react`, `lenis`, `three`, `@react-three/fiber`, `@react-three/drei`, `@react-three/postprocessing`, `postprocessing`, `n8ao`, `roughjs`, `react-router-dom`, `clsx`, `tailwind-merge`, `@radix-ui/react-accordion`, `@radix-ui/react-dialog`). `metadata.json`, `index.html`, `package.json`, `src/index.css` configured.\n- **Content & Tooling**:\n  - `/src/content/index.ts`, `/scripts/check-release.ts` (`npm run check:release` works, lists 76 TODOs).\n- **Lib & Providers**:\n  - `/src/lib/utils.ts`, `/src/lib/gsap.ts`, `/src/lib/quality.ts`, `/src/lib/storyStore.ts`, `/src/lib/roughPaths.ts`.\n  - `/src/app/QualityProvider.tsx`, `/src/app/SmoothScroll.tsx`.\n- **UI & Sketch Kit**:\n  - `/src/components/ui/accordion.tsx`, `/src/components/ui/sheet.tsx`, `/src/components/ui/doodle-crew-footer.tsx` (byte-for-byte copy + the 4 additive edits).\n  - `/src/components/sketch/`: `LineBoilFilters.tsx`, `PaperBackground.tsx`, `RoughBox.tsx`, `RoughHighlight.tsx`, `InkArrow.tsx`, `WashiTape.tsx` (supports optional `color`), `PolaroidFrame.tsx`, `Stamp.tsx`, `HandIcon.tsx`, `Mascots.tsx`, `StickerButton.tsx`, `IslandIllustrations.tsx` (`SeedSketchSvg`, `IslandSketchSvg`), `index.ts`.\n  - `/src/components/layout/`: `Nav.tsx`, `DevTodoBadge.tsx`, `PageShell.tsx` (lazy-loads `DevTodoBadge` only under `import.meta.env.DEV`).\n- **3D Island & Effects**:\n  - `/src/three/island/islandGenerator.ts` (exports `BLOCK_TYPES` + `BlockType`, ~4,600 blocks, deterministic, anchors).\n  - `/src/three/island/textures.ts` (64\303\22764 procedural buffers + materials; `emissiveMap` only set when defined).\n  - `/src/three/effects/SketchEffect.ts` (uses custom GLSL `sketchLuma` helper; compiles cleanly with 0 shader errors).\n  - `/src/three/effects/PostFX.tsx`, `/src/three/island/IslandBlocks.tsx`, `/src/three/story/StorySetPieces.tsx`, `/src/three/story/CameraRig.tsx`, `/src/three/IslandCanvas.tsx`.\n- **Sections & Pages**:\n  - `/src/sections/plans/`: `PlanCard.tsx`, `PlanGrid.tsx`, `CompareTable.tsx`.\n  - `/src/sections/home/`: `PlansHighlight.tsx`, `TrustStrip.tsx`, `FAQ.tsx`, `FinalCTA.tsx`, `PanelSketch.tsx`, `ChapterCard.tsx`, `StoryVine.tsx`, `StoryStatic.tsx`, `Story.tsx`.\n  - `/src/pages/`: `Home.tsx`, `Plans.tsx`, `NotFound.tsx`, `DevSketch.tsx`, `DevTextures.tsx`.\n  - `/src/App.tsx`: complete routing + `RouteScrollSync` + `QualityProvider` + `SmoothScrollProvider` + `PageShell`.\n- **Verified Passing Checks (after latest code edits)**:\n  - Unit tests (`npx --yes tsx --test src/content/content.test.ts src/lib/quality.test.ts src/lib/storyStore.test.ts src/lib/roughPaths.test.ts src/three/island/islandGenerator.test.ts src/three/island/textures.test.ts src/components/ui/doodle-crew-footer.test.ts src/sections/sections.test.tsx`): **42/42 pass** (including SSR tests for Sketch kit, Plans, TrustStrip, FAQ, StoryStatic, Nav, NotFound, DoodleCrewFooter).\n  - `compile_applet`: succeeded.\n  - `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`): 0 errors.\n  - Production build `NODE_ENV=production npx vite build`: succeeded (`index.js` 212KB gz, lazy `IslandCanvas.js` 385KB gz, `NO_DEV_PAGES`; note `\"TODO \303\227\"` match in `dist/` earlier was only inside `dist/assets/aistudio/*.md` attachments copied from `public/`, NOT in JS bundles).\n  - Playwright Round 2 (`1440\303\227900`):\n    - **0 console errors** on `/` and `/plans` and `goBack` to `/`!\n    - Inspected screenshots: `home-hero.png` (ink sketch seed block + sapling + SplitText + wavy pink underline), `story-roots.png` (cutaway stone + glow ore veins), `story-shield.png` (radial grass reveal + watercolor edge wash + petal dome), `story-build.png` (aerial island + PanelSketch Modpacks click), `story-neighbors.png` (dusk lanterns + voxel Nodey & Sprout), `story-bloom.png` (polaroid shrink frame), `home-plans.png` (frozen Bloom 3D snapshot inside polaroid + OUR PICK stamp on Sapling), `plans-desktop.png` captured.\n    - Confirmed `/plans`: `cardCount: 6`, `ourPickCount: 1`, `overflow: false`, `faqCount: 5`.\n    - Confirmed route hopping `/` -> `/plans` -> `go-back`: `path: \"/\"`, `pinSpacers: 1`, `scrollY: 0`, `hasCanvas: true`, 0 console errors.\n    - Confirmed `/missing-page` 404 snapshot (`\"This page didn\'t sprout.\"` + `\"Back home\"` link `/`).\n    - **Not yet inspected / still needed**: View `plans-desktop.png` & `not-found.png`, complete `/?static=1` + mobile `390\303\227844` (`mobile-hero.png`, `mobile-menu.png`, `/plans` sticky compare table) Playwright checks cleanly, and fix 1 minor visual defect seen in `story-shield.png`.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- Vite dev server runs with `DISABLE_HMR=true` and `watch: null` (`vite.config.ts`), so code edits are ONLY served by the live dev server after calling `restart_dev_server`.\n- In Vite production builds, `import.meta.env.DEV` is statically stripped, while Node `tsx` has `import.meta.env === undefined`. `PageShell.tsx` uses `typeof import.meta.env !== \"undefined\" && import.meta.env.DEV ? React.lazy(...) : null` so both Vite DCE and Node SSR tests work cleanly.\n- In Playwright headless Chromium on SwiftShader CPU, scrolling to `footer` and running a screenshot without `animations: \"disabled\"` (or after triggering `feTurbulence` SVG filter repaint on the giant wordmark) can stall/timeout; always use `animations: \"disabled\"` in `run-code` screenshots and avoid triggering `MouseEvent` right before `goto` when SwiftShader is mid-repaint, or inspect footer DOM + fast viewport screenshot separately if needed.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n1. `SketchEffect.ts` GLSL error (`linearToRelativeLuminance : no matching overloaded function found` in Three r187): Defined custom `sketchLuma(vec3 c)` helper and replaced all calls. Fixed; 0 WebGL/shader console errors in Round 2.\n2. `THREE.Material: parameter \'emissiveMap\' has value of undefined` warnings: Fixed in `src/three/island/textures.ts` by only attaching `emissiveMap` when defined. Eliminated 19 warnings.\n3. Parallel `replace_file_content` on `Story.tsx` initially dropped first chunk: Verified with `view_file` and re-applied cleanly via single `multi_replace_file_content`. Added `lg:left-8 lg:right-28` so right-aligned cards clear `StoryVine`.\n4. `PlanCard` `OUR PICK` stamp overlapped card border/tape: Lifted to `-top-4 right-3` with `bg-paper shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--color-ink)]`; verified clean in `home-plans.png`.\n5. `sections.test.tsx` SSR apostrophe escaping (`&#x27;`) & wrong crew test expectation (`Bruno`/`Juno` vs `Mochi`): Fixed; 42/42 pass.\n6. Playwright selector quote syntax error on last run (`main a[href=/]` unquoted `/` aborted bash script right before `/?static=1` and mobile checks): Use properly quoted/escaped JS or run those remaining Playwright checks cleanly next.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Workspace: `/app/applet`. Temp verification folder currently present at `.playwright-verify/` (MUST be deleted before finishing!).\n- Note minor visual polish spotted in `story-shield.png` (`/.playwright-verify/story-shield.png`):\n  - The Shield annotation `\"boing. not today.\"` was positioned at the right side and slightly overlapped behind the left edge of the right-aligned `Shield` `ChapterCard`!\n  - Fix in `src/sections/home/Story.tsx` (`handleProjectAnchors`): on desktop (`width >= 768`), account for which side the current `ChapterCard` sits on (`left` cards sit in roughly `x: 32..480` for `roots`, `build`, `bloom`; `right` cards sit in roughly `x: width - 540 .. width - 112` for `shield`, `neighbors`). Clamp `clampedLx` away from the active card\'s horizontal band so live annotations NEVER slide behind a `ChapterCard`!\n\n## 6. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. **Fix minor Shield annotation overlap in `/src/sections/home/Story.tsx`**:\n   - In `handleProjectAnchors`, restrict `clampedLx` on desktop (`width >= 768`) to avoid the active chapter card region:\n     - Left-card chapters (`roots`, `build`): `minLx = Math.min(470, width * 0.42)`, `maxLx = width - boxW - 120`.\n     - Right-card chapters (`shield`, `neighbors`): `minLx = 24`, `maxLx = Math.max(24, width - boxW - 550)`.\n2. **View existing Round 2 screenshots (`/.playwright-verify/plans-desktop.png`, `/.playwright-verify/not-found.png`)** via `view_file` to verify Plans & 404 visually.\n3. **Restart dev server (`restart_dev_server`) & run remaining Playwright checks** (clean single bash script with `trap \"playwright-cli close >/dev/null 2>&1 || true\" EXIT`):\n   - Desktop `1440\303\227900`: re-capture `story-shield.png` and `story-neighbors.png` to verify `\"boing. not today.\"` & `\"that\'s us. hi!\"` sit completely unobstructed; verify `/` `0` console errors.\n   - `/?static=1`: capture `home-static.png`, verify `data-story-mode=\"static\"`, `0` `<canvas>` elements, and cumulative `IslandSketchSvg` stages.\n   - Mobile `390\303\227844`: capture `mobile-hero.png`, click menu button & capture `mobile-menu.png` (notebook Sheet), check `/` and `/plans` mobile overflow (`documentElement.scrollWidth <= window.innerWidth`) & sticky first column on `CompareTable`, capture `plans-mobile.png`.\n   - Inspect new screenshots via `view_file`.\n4. **Cleanup & Final Verification**:\n   - Remove temporary `/.playwright-verify` folder (and ensure `.playwright-cli` / any temp artifacts don\'t pollute project code).\n   - Run final verification AFTER last edit:\n     - `npx --yes tsx --test src/content/content.test.ts src/lib/quality.test.ts src/lib/storyStore.test.ts src/lib/roughPaths.test.ts src/three/island/islandGenerator.test.ts src/three/island/textures.test.ts src/components/ui/doodle-crew-footer.test.ts src/sections/sections.test.tsx`\n     - `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` in parallel\n     - Verify `grep -q \"TODO \303\227\" dist/assets/*.js` returns non-zero (not in production JS bundles).\n     - `restart_dev_server` so preview is up cleanly on port 3000.\n5. **Provide concise final summary** to the user.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Never invent facts, prices, hardware, or reviews \342\200\224 keep all `TODO`s intact.\n- Zero Mojang textures/assets; keep footer Mojang disclaimer visible.\n- `lucide-react` ONLY for `Menu`, `X`, `ChevronDown`, `ExternalLink`, `Check`.\n- Always close Playwright (`playwright-cli close`) cleanly via `trap` and remove temporary `.playwright-verify/` before completion.\n- Run final test + `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` AFTER the very last code edit.\n</summary>"
