 - paragraph: your world, day 1 of forever\n        - generic [ref=e62]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e63]: minecraft server hosting, grown with care\n          - heading \"Plant a seed. Grow a world.\" [level=1] [ref=e64]:\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e65]: Plant\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e66]: a\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e67]: seed.\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e68]: Grow\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e69]: a\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e72]: world\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e73]: .\n          - paragraph [ref=e74]: Fast servers, always-on protection and one-click setup, with real humans on Discord when you need them. Every world starts as a little sapling.\n          - generic [ref=e75]:\n            - link \"Get a server\" [ref=e76] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"TODO: Paymenter store URL\"\n            - link \"See plans\" [ref=e77] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: /plans\n        - generic:\n          - generic:\n            - generic:\n              - generic:\n                - generic:\n                  - generic:\n                    - paragraph: 01 \302\267 roots\n                    - heading \"Strong roots, zero lag.\" [level=2]\n                    - paragraph: \"Every world grows on hardware picked for one job: keeping Minecraft ticking smoothly. High-clock CPUs that love single-thread work, fast storage so chunks load before you get there, and plenty of quick memory.\"\n                    - generic: \"TODO: confirm and name the storage type (e.g. NVMe) once confirmed\"\n                    - generic:\n                      - generic:\n                        - term: CPU\n                        - definition:\n                          - generic: TODO\n                          - generic: TODO\n                      - generic:\n                        - term: Storage\n                        - definition:\n                          -