      full: "### Browser `default` opened with pid 3154.### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.goto(\'http://127.0.0.1:3000/\');```### Page- Page URL: http://127.0.0.1:3000/- Page Title: Petalnode: Minecraft Server Hosting, Grown With Care### Snapshot- [Snapshot](.playwright-cli/page-2026-11-20T14-26-08-761Z.yml)### Events- New console entries: .playwright-cli/console-2026-11-20T14-26-04-908Z.log#L1{  \"errors\": [],  \"shieldInfo\": {    \"scrollY\": 1665,    \"stageRect\": {      \"x\": 0,      \"y\": -1665,      \"width\": 1440,      \"height\": 5400,      \"top\": -1665,      \"right\": 1440,      \"bottom\": 3735,      \"left\": 0    },    \"cardRect\": {      \"x\": 854.6890258789062,      \"y\": 271.5163269042969,      \"width\": 426.62188720703125,      \"height\": 356.9673156738281,      \"top\": 271.5163269042969,      \"right\": 1281.3109130859375,      \"bottom\": 628.483642578125,      \"left\": 854.6890258789062    },    \"cardOpacity\": \"1\",    \"annRect\": {      \"x\": 611,      \"y\": 357.20001220703125,      \"width\": 160.5,      \"height\": 32.65625,      \"top\": 357.20001220703125,      \"right\": 771.5,      \"bottom\": 389.85626220703125,      \"left\": 611    },    \"annOpacity\": \"1\"  },  \"footerOk\": {    \"hasWordmark\": true,    \"hasDisclaimer\": true,    \"overflow\": false  },  \"staticCheck\": {    \"mode\": \"static\",    \"canvasCount\": 0,    \"stageCount\": 5,    \"overflow\": false  },  \"mobileHome\": {    \"overflow\": false,    \"hasCanvas\": true  },  \"mobilePlans\": {    \"overflow\": false,    \"stickyComputed\": \"sticky\",    \"cardCount\": 6  }}"
