    thinking: "**Assessing Visual Elements**\n\nI\'m focused on the visual impact. Everything is hitting the mark brilliantly, except for a few specific image files. I need to take a closer look at those files to determine why they\'re not quite as effective as the others. Specifically: `story-shield.png`, `story-neighbors.png`, `home-static.png`, `mobile-hero.png`, `mobile-menu.png`, `plans-mobile.png`.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Details**\n\nI\'m thrilled with the recent refinements! `story-shield.png` is pristine, with no overlap and a perfect arrow. `story-neighbors.png` flawlessly points to Nodey, and the SVG seed island is perfect in `home-static.png`. `mobile-hero.png` and `mobile-menu.png` are also perfect, but I just caught a small, unexpected detail in `home-footer.png`! What\'s the deal with that tiny black pixel?! Time to investigate the code.\n\n\n"
