  planner_response {
    response: "I have built and verified the frontend website for **Petalnode**.\n\n### Implemented Features & Routes\n- **Home (`/`)**:\n  - **Hero & Pinned 3D Scroll Story**: 6-chapter scrubbed Three.js / React Three Fiber floating cherry-blossom island progression (`Seed \342\206\222 Roots \342\206\222 Shield \342\206\222 Instant Build \342\206\222 Neighbors \342\206\222 Bloom`) driven deterministically from `storyStore.progress`, with custom procedural 64\303\22764 voxel textures, post-processing ink-sketch reveal shader, live-projected 3D margin annotations, an interactive `StoryVine` navigator, and a Bloom Polaroid frame transition.\n  - **Static & Reduced-Motion Fallback (`/?static=1`)**: Renders zero `<canvas>` elements with 2D progressive island SVG illustrations when static mode, reduced motion, unavailable WebGL, or context loss triggers.\n  - **Plans Highlight**: Frozen Bloom snapshot polaroid next to `Sprout`, `Sapling` (`OUR PICK`), and `Blossom` tier cards.\n  - **Trust Strip, FAQ, Final CTA & Doodle Crew Footer**: Hand-drawn sketchbook chrome (`RoughBox`, `WashiTape`, `Stamp`, `StickerButton`, `Nodey`), accordion FAQ, and interactive `PETALNODE` dry-brush footer with all 6 crew mascots and the Mojang disclaimer.\n- **Plans (`/plans`)**:\n  - All six tier cards (`Seed`, `Sprout`, `Sapling`, `Blossom`, `Grove`, `Orchard`), a horizontally scrollable ruled-notebook comparison table with a sticky `Feature` column, and the filtered FAQ subset.\n- **404 (`/*`) & Dev Galleries**:\n  - Not-found view with Nodey and wilted Sprout, plus dev-only `/dev/sketch` and `/dev/textures` routes and `TODO \303\227 76` counter stripped from production bundles.\n\n### Verification Results\n- **Unit & SSR Tests**: All 42 tests pass across content schema, quality tiering, story range helpers, deterministic roughjs geometry, island generation, procedural textures, footer pure math, and SSR section rendering.\n- **Build & Type Check**: `compile_applet`, `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`), and production `vite build` succeeded with 0 errors and verified no dev badge or dev pages leak into production JS assets.\n- **Headless Browser Verification**: Inspected rendered screenshots and DOM/console state across desktop (`1440\303\227900`), mobile (`390\303\227844`), static mode (`/?static=1`), `/plans` (sticky compare column, 0 horizontal overflow), 404 route, and footer crew storyboard with 0 console errors.\n- **Release Readiness (`npm run check:release`)**: Intentionally reports the 76 remaining `TODO` content/URL placeholders in `src/content/index.ts` ready for final copy and links before launch."
    message_id: "eVkAa5zaDcKf3boP8L6U2Qc"
