  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Visual Fit**\n\nI\'ve successfully implemented dynamic measurement of any wordmark using canvas/SVG metrics within `DoodleCrewFooter`, achieving a clean viewBox fit. I\'ve also confirmed that `PETALNODES` with `letter: 9` works great for the `Patch` wordmark. My next task is to organize this implementation into focused, well-structured modules with strong typing to maintain crisp, maintainable code.\n\n\n**Consolidating Content Structure**\n\nI\'m establishing a centralized content system using `/src/content/index.ts` and `/src/content/pages.ts`. I want this entry point to re-export long-form page copy neatly from `/src/content/pages.ts`, ensuring that `@/content` is the go-to for all site content. I\'m keen on the `listTodos()` function, ensuring it thoroughly scans all new content objects for TODOs, so that `npm run check:release` provides a complete picture of remaining tasks. I\'m also ensuring `URL_KEY_HINT` correctly flags URLs.\n\n\n**Implementing Data Validation**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the implementation of robust data validation within `/src/content/pages.ts`, ensuring that `npm run check:release` accurately flags missing checkout URLs and other critical TODO items. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the integration of URL checks to adhere to the user prompt\'s requirement for manual review of checkout URLs. This will ensure that our tests, including those in `content.test.ts` and `sections.test.tsx`, consistently catch any omissions. I\'m starting by structuring data for locations, beginning with Singapore, Miami, and India.\n\n\n**Structuring Content Verification**\n\nI\'m now expanding content with `docsPage`, `modpacksPage`, `aboutPage`, `contactPage`, and `legalDocs`, focusing on *verified* data. I\'m prioritizing clear documentation and transparent `TODO` markers. Crucially, I\'m refraining from inventing details, like address data, and only including actual server software. This ensures authenticity and that I only document confirmed features, with explicit gaps highlighted.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "-IMAa4rOLLWtz7IPsKrioQ8"
