            lines {
              text: "        title: \"4. Free & Boost Reward Tiers\","
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "        body: \"Petal invite servers and Bloom Discord boost reward servers are claimed via Discord Support Tickets. Free invite rewards remain subject to invite-integrity rules (Member Leave \342\210\2222, Rejoin \342\210\2221, Fake/Alt \342\210\2222, Mass Ping Invite Reset). Bloom boost rewards require active boosts to be maintained.\","
