  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Integrating Button Support**\n\nI\'m currently focused on Phase 6, specifically integrating button support across core components. I\'m updating `StickerButton.tsx`, `Nav.tsx`, `PanelSketch.tsx`, `PlanCard.tsx`, `PlanGrid.tsx`, `CompareTable.tsx`, and `TrustStrip.tsx`. The goal is clean integration, ensuring all the new content and interactions are supported without introducing any regressions.\n\n\n**Refining Button Interactions**\n\nI\'ve just finished up the `StickerButton.tsx` upgrade. It supports a variety of button styles and functionalities. I\'ve integrated React Router link support, various states (loading, disabled, etc.), and icons. The focus was on keeping the aesthetic consistent with the Petalnodes sketchbook theme while ensuring accessibility. Next up is matching the navigation items to Section 8, for the `Nav.tsx` file.\n\n\n**Analyzing Desktop Navigation**\n\nI\'m now carefully analyzing the desktop navigation layout. Specifically, I\'m checking the display of the 6 internal links, the external \"Discord\" link, the \"Client Area\" CTA, and the brand logo across different screen sizes. My focus is on the `xl:` and `lg:` sizes, ensuring no wrapping or overflow. I\'m aiming for a clean, horizontal line using specific `gap` and `px` values. I also have to account for the `< lg` layout, using a `Sheet` drawer for routes.\n\nNext, I\'ll update `PanelSketch.tsx`.\n\n\n**Updating Plan Display**\n\nI\'m currently updating the plan display. I\'ve added `\"sakura\"` to `PlanGrowthIllustration` and `PLAN_SEEDS`. I\'ve fixed `PlanGrid.tsx` so the 7 plans display correctly in a 3-column desktop grid, with the \"Sakura\" plan highlighted. I\'m also updating `CompareTable.tsx` so all confirmed Minecraft features show accurately.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "P4QAa8avLfXpz7IP8MCckAw"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7455089392352624377"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import * as React from \\\"react\\\";\\nimport { Link } from \\\"react-router-dom\\\";\\nimport { isTodo } from \\\"@/content\\\";\\nimport { cn } from \\\"@/lib/utils\\\";\\n\\nexport interface StickerButtonProps {\\n  children: React.ReactNode;\\n  href?: string;\\n  to?: string;\\n  onClick?: (e: React.MouseEvent<HTMLElement>) => void;\\n  variant?: \\\"primary\\\" | \\\"outline\\\" | \\\"dark\\\";\\n  size?: \\\"sm\\\" | \\\"md\\\" | \\\"lg\\\";\\n  external?: boolean;\\n  disabled?: boolean;\\n  loading?: boolean;\\n  loadingText?: string;\\n  leftIcon?: React.ReactNode;\\n  rightIcon?: React.ReactNode;\\n  type?: \\\"button\\\" | \\\"submit\\\" | \\\"reset\\\";\\n  className?: string;\\n  \\\"aria-label\\\"?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport function StickerButton({\\n  children,\\n  href,\\n  to,\\n  onClick,\\n  variant = \\\"primary\\\",\\n  size = \\\"md\\\",\\n  external = false,\\n  disabled = false,\\n  loading = false,\\n  loadingText,\\n  leftIcon,\\n  rightIcon,\\n  type = \\\"button\\\",\\n  className,\\n  \\\"aria-label\\\": ariaLabel,\\n}: StickerButtonProps) {\\n  const [isPressed, setIsPressed] = React.useState(false);\\n  const todoHref = href && isTodo(href);\\n  const isDev = Boolean(import.meta.env?.DEV);\\n  const isInert = disabled || loading;\\n\\n  const variantClasses =\\n    variant === \\\"primary\\\"\\n      ? \\\"bg-blossom-600 text-white hover:bg-blossom-600/95\\\"\\n      : variant === \\\"dark\\\"\\n        ? \\\"bg-ink text-paper hover:bg-ink/90\\\"\\n        : \\\"bg-paper text-ink hover:bg-blossom-50\\\";\\n\\n  const sizeClasses =\\n    size === \\\"sm\\\"\\n      ? \\\"h-10 px-4 text-sm\\\"\\n      : size === \\\"lg\\\"\\n        ? \\\"h-13 px-7 text-base md:text-lg\\\"\\n        : \\\"h-11 px-5 text-[15px]\\\";\\n\\n  const devTodoClass =\\n    todoHref && isDev\\n      ? \\\"border-dashed outline-2 outline-dashed outline-blossom-600/50 outline-offset-2\\\"\\n      : \\\"\\\";\\n\\n  const sharedClass = cn(\\n    \\\"sticker-btn rounded-sm font-display font-bold whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-dashed focus-visible:outline-ink focus-visible:outline-offset-3\\\",\\n    isInert\\n      ? \\\"opacity-60 cursor-not-allowed pointer-events-none shadow-[1px_1px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\"\\n      : \\\"cursor-pointer\\\",\\n    isPressed && !isInert && \\\"translate-y-[2px] translate-x-[2px] shadow-[1px_1px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\",\\n    variantClasses,\\n    sizeClasses,\\n    devTodoClass,\\n    className,\\n  );\\n\\n  const pressHandlers = isInert\\n    ? {}\\n    : {\\n        onPointerDown: () => setIsPressed(true),\\n        onPointerUp: () => setIsPressed(false),\\n        onPointerLeave: () => setIsPressed(false),\\n        onPointerCancel: () => setIsPressed(false),\\n        onKeyDown: (e: React.KeyboardEvent<HTMLElement>) => {\\n          if (e.key === \\\" \\\" || e.key === \\\"Enter\\\") setIsPressed(true);\\n        },\\n        onKeyUp: (e: React.KeyboardEvent<HTMLElement>) => {\\n          if (e.key === \\\" \\\" || e.key === \\\"Enter\\\") setIsPressed(false);\\n        },\\n      };\\n\\n  const innerContent = (\\n    <>\\n      {loading && (\\n        <span\\n          aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n          className=\\\"inline-block h-3.5 w-3.5 rounded-full border-2 border-current border-t-transparent animate-spin shrink-0\\\"\\n        />\\n      )}\\n      {!loading && leftIcon && <span className=\\\"inline-flex shrink-0\\\">{leftIcon}</span>}\\n      <span>{loading && loadingText ? loadingText : children}</span>\\n      {!loading && rightIcon && <span className=\\\"inline-flex shrink-0\\\">{rightIcon}</span>}\\n    </>\\n  );\\n\\n  if (to && !isInert) {\\n    return (\\n      <Link\\n        to={to}\\n        onClick={(e) => onClick?.(e)}\\n        aria-label={ariaLabel}\\n        aria-busy={loading || undefined}\\n        className={sharedClass}\\n        {...pressHandlers}\\n      >\\n        {innerContent}\\n      </Link>\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  if (href && !isInert) {\\n    return (\\n      <a\\n        href={href}\\n        onClick={(e) => {\\n          if (todoHref) {\\n            e.preventDefault();\\n          }\\n          onClick?.(e);\\n        }}\\n        target={external && !todoHref ? \\\"_blank\\\" : undefined}\\n        rel={external && !todoHref ? \\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" : undefined}\\n        title={todoHref && isDev ? \\\"TODO: link\\\" : undefined}\\n        aria-label={ariaLabel}\\n        aria-busy={loading || undefined}\\n        className={sharedClass}\\n        {...pressHandlers}\\n      >\\n        {innerContent}\\n      </a>\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  return (\\n    <button\\n      type={type}\\n      disabled={isInert}\\n      aria-disabled={isInert || undefined}\\n      aria-busy={loading || undefined}\\n      onClick={(e) => {\\n        if (!isInert) onClick?.(e);\\n      }}\\n      aria-label={ariaLabel}\\n      className={sharedClass}\\n      {...pressHandlers}\\n    >\\n      {innerContent}\\n    </button>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Upgrade StickerButton with React Router support, tactile pointer/keyboard press states, disabled/loading states, icons, and accessible ARIA attributes in Petalnodes sketchbook styling.\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/sketch/StickerButton.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Upgrading StickerButton interactions and states\", \"toolSummary\":\"Upgrade StickerButton component\"}"
