  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding Quick Links**\n\nI\'m currently updating `/src/sections/home/PlansHighlight.tsx`. I\'ve added quick links or teasers right below the \"See all seven plans \342\206\222\" button, specifically for Free Invite Rewards (Petal I\342\200\223VI) and Boost Rewards (Bloom). I aim to provide users with direct access to these reward categories.\n\n\n**Refining Layout Options**\n\nI\'m now deliberating on layout options. I\'m considering keeping the `PlansHighlight.tsx` file super concise with only a direct link to all seven plans, free rewards, and boost tiers. Alternatively, I am considering having the file link to `/vps` as well. In addition, I am going to check `Story.tsx` and `PlanGrid.tsx` to verify the 7 plan changes are correct. The next phase is to focus on creating missing pages and updating the plans page with the free rewards and boost rewards.\nI\'ll also design a shared `<PageHeading />` helper to reuse or follow the clean sketchbook header style.\n\n\n**Designing New Rewards**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in developing the new `/src/sections/plans/RewardsSection.tsx`. I\'m going to render the free Minecraft server rewards, specifically the Petal I to VI, which comes with invite rules. I am also working on the Discord boost rewards, Bloom I to IV, which will include an active-boost warning banner and Discord ticket CTA. I\'ll utilize `RoughBox`, `WashiTape`, `Stamp`, and `StickerButton` components.\n\n\n**Developing New Pages**\n\nI\'m now focused on creating new pages: `/src/pages/BotHosting.tsx`, `/src/pages/Locations.tsx`, and `/src/pages/Docs.tsx`. I\'m working on a dedicated Bot Hosting page with draft tiers and feature cards, a visual world map highlighting locations, and an organized interactive knowledge base. The Bot Hosting page will include Discord and billing CTAs. The location page will include detailed regional cards. The docs page will be interactive and include live search.\n\n\n**Defining New Pages**\n\nI\'m now deep in defining new pages. I\'m building out `/src/pages/Modpacks.tsx` which will cover Minecraft engines and a modpack upload walkthrough. I\'m also preparing `/src/pages/About.tsx`, detailing our story and core pillars, with specs. Finally, I\'m working on `/src/pages/Contact.tsx`, focusing on support channels, while leaving out invented emails or phones. I\'m also confirming that `/src/pages/LegalPage.tsx` will cleanly render legal documents.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "fYQAa_72Af7oz7IP397uoA0"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5728689469583336538"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import * as React from \\\"react\\\";\\nimport { Check, Sparkles } from \\\"lucide-react\\\";\\nimport { boostRewards, freeRewards, links } from \\\"@/content\\\";\\nimport { RoughBox, Stamp, StickerButton, WashiTape } from \\\"@/components/sketch\\\";\\n\\nexport function RewardsSection() {\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"mt-24 space-y-20\\\">\\n      {/* Free Minecraft Server Rewards: Petal I \342\200\223 VI */}\\n      <section id=\\\"free-rewards\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"free-rewards-heading\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-6 mb-10\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"max-w-2xl\\\">\\n            <p className=\\\"font-handwriting text-lg font-semibold text-blossom-600 mb-1\\\">\\n              invite rewards\\n            </p>\\n            <h2\\n              id=\\\"free-rewards-heading\\\"\\n              className=\\\"font-display-tight text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink\\\"\\n            >\\n              {freeRewards.heading}\\n            </h2>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-3 text-base text-ink-soft leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              {freeRewards.sub}\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n          <StickerButton href={links.discord} external variant=\\\"outline\\\" size=\\\"md\\\">\\n            {freeRewards.claimCta}\\n          </StickerButton>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\\\">\\n          {freeRewards.tiers.map((tier, idx) => (\\n            <div key={tier.id} className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-2.5 left-6 z-20\\\">\\n                <WashiTape rotation={idx % 2 === 0 ? -4 : 4} length={72} />\\n              </div>\\n              <RoughBox\\n                seed={710 + idx}\\n                bgClassName=\\\"bg-paper-shade\\\"\\n                padding=\\\"p-5 pt-6\\\"\\n                className=\\\"shadow-[3px_4px_0_var(--color-ink)] h-full\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"font-display-tight text-2xl text-ink\\\">{tier.name}</h3>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-pixel text-2xl text-blossom-600\\\">\\n                    {tier.ramGb} GB RAM\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <p className=\\\"mt-2 font-handwriting text-base text-ink-soft\\\">\\n                  Requires{\\\" \\\"}\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-bold text-ink\\\">{tier.invitesRequired} Invites</span>\\n                </p>\\n                <p className=\\\"mt-3 text-xs text-ink-soft border-t border-dashed border-paper-line pt-2.5\\\">\\n                  Claim through a Discord Support Ticket.\\n                </p>\\n              </RoughBox>\\n            </div>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Invite rules card */}\\n        <RoughBox\\n          seed={730}\\n          bgClassName=\\\"bg-paper\\\"\\n          padding=\\\"p-5 sm:p-6\\\"\\n          className=\\\"mt-8 shadow-[3px_4px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\"\\n        >\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <h3 className=\\\"font-display-tight text-xl text-ink\\\">\\n                Invite Integrity Rules\\n              </h3>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-sm text-ink-soft mt-1\\\">\\n                Verified invites remain subject to automated community tracking rules:\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3\\\">\\n              {freeRewards.rules.map((rule) => (\\n                <div\\n                  key={rule.label}\\n                  className=\\\"border border-ink/30 bg-paper-shade rounded-sm px-3 py-2 text-center\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-soft\\\">\\n                    {rule.label}\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"font-pixel text-lg text-blossom-600 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                    {rule.penalty}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              ))}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </RoughBox>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      {/* Discord Boost Rewards: Bloom I \342\200\223 IV */}\\n      <section id=\\\"boost-rewards\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"boost-rewards-heading\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-6 mb-8\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"max-w-2xl\\\">\\n            <p className=\\\"font-handwriting text-lg font-semibold text-blossom-600 mb-1\\\">\\n              discord perks\\n            </p>\\n            <h2\\n              id=\\\"boost-rewards-heading\\\"\\n              className=\\\"font-display-tight text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink\\\"\\n            >\\n              {boostRewards.heading}\\n            </h2>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-3 text-base text-ink-soft leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              {boostRewards.sub}\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n          <StickerButton href={links.discord} external variant=\\\"primary\\\" size=\\\"md\\\">\\n            {boostRewards.claimCta}\\n          </StickerButton>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Active boost requirement callout */}\\n        <RoughBox\\n          seed={750}\\n          bgClassName=\\\"bg-blossom-50\\\"\\n          padding=\\\"p-4 sm:p-5\\\"\\n          className=\\\"mb-8 shadow-[3px_3px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\"\\n        >\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-start gap-3\\\">\\n              <Sparkles className=\\\"h-5 w-5 text-blossom-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n              <p className=\\\"font-display font-bold text-ink text-sm sm:text-base\\\">\\n                {boostRewards.requirementBanner}\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <Stamp text=\\\"ACTIVE BOOST REQUIRED\\\" rotation={-2} size=\\\"sm\\\" className=\\\"shrink-0 bg-paper\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n        </RoughBox>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\\\">\\n          {boostRewards.tiers.map((tier, idx) => (\\n            <div key={tier.id} className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-2.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-20\\\">\\n                <WashiTape\\n                  rotation={idx % 2 === 0 ? -3 : 3}\\n                  length={76}\\n                  color=\\\"#FF8FAB\\\"\\n                />\\n              </div>\\n              <RoughBox\\n                seed={770 + idx}\\n                bgClassName=\\\"bg-paper\\\"\\n                padding=\\\"p-5 pt-6\\\"\\n                className=\\\"shadow-[3px_4px_0_var(--color-ink)] h-full flex flex-col\\\"\\n              >\\n                <h3 className=\\\"font-display-tight text-2xl text-ink\\\">{tier.name}</h3>\\n                <p className=\\\"mt-1 font-pixel text-3xl text-blossom-600\\\">\\n                  {tier.ramGb} GB RAM\\n                </p>\\n                <p className=\\\"mt-2 font-handwriting text-base font-bold text-ink\\\">\\n                  {tier.boostsRequired}{\\\" \\\"}\\n                  {tier.boostsRequired === 1 ? \\\"Active Boost\\\" : \\\"Active Boosts\\\"}\\n                </p>\\n                <ul className=\\\"mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-dashed border-paper-line space-y-1.5 text-xs text-ink-soft\\\">\\n                  {boostRewards.specs.map((spec) => (\\n                    <li key={spec} className=\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n                      <Check className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-moss shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                      <span>{spec}</span>\\n                    </li>\\n                  ))}\\n                </ul>\\n              </RoughBox>\\n            </div>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create RewardsSection component displaying Petal I\342\200\223VI Free Server Invite Rewards with integrity rules and Bloom I\342\200\223IV Discord Boost Rewards with prominent active-boost requirement notice.\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/sections/plans/RewardsSection.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating RewardsSection for Petal and Bloom tiers\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create RewardsSection component\"}"
