  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nContinuing development of the **Petalnodes** Cherry Blossom Minecraft & VPS hosting platform website following the Master Prompt (`PETALNODES \342\200\224 COMPLETE WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT & BRAND UPDATE`).\n\n### Core Confirmed Brand Data & Deliverables:\n- **Brand**: `Petalnodes` (`wordmark`: `\"PETALNODES\"`, `logoText`: `\"petalnodes\"`). Keep existing `/metadata.json` (`\"name\": \"Petalnode\"`) unrenamed per environment constraints. Keep exact Mojang disclaimer: `\"Not an official Minecraft product. Not approved by or associated with Mojang or Microsoft.\"`\n- **Confirmed URLs**:\n  - Website: `https://petalnodes.cloud`\n  - Billing / Store: `https://billing.petalnodes.cloud`\n  - Client Area: `https://billing.petalnodes.cloud`\n  - Game Panel: `https://panel.petalnodes.cloud`\n  - Discord: `https://discord.gg/GS3wuc4HGk`\n  - Status Page: `https://status.petalnodes.cloud`\n- **Social Media**: YouTube (`Petalnodes`), X (`@petalnodes`), Instagram (`@petalnodes`) \342\200\224 keep hrefs as `TODO` and hidden from footer until exact profile URLs are verified (`footerConfig.socials` filters `!isTodo`). **TikTok is NOT available \342\200\224 do not display it anywhere.**\n- **A. Minecraft Hosting \342\200\224 7 Cherry Blossom Tiers** (`/plans`):\n  - `Seed`: 2GB | 100% CPU | 10GB NVMe | `\342\202\27159/mo`\n  - `Sprout`: 4GB | 150% CPU | 15GB NVMe | `\342\202\27199/mo`\n  - `Sapling` (`OUR PICK`): 8GB | 250% CPU | 25GB NVMe | `\342\202\271169/mo`\n  - `Blossom`: 12GB | 350% CPU | 35GB NVMe | `\342\202\271239/mo`\n  - `Grove`: 16GB | 400% CPU | 45GB NVMe | `\342\202\271299/mo`\n  - `Orchard`: 20GB | 500% CPU | 55GB NVMe | `\342\202\271369/mo`\n  - `Sakura`: 24GB | 600% CPU | 65GB NVMe | `\342\202\271449/mo`\n  - Confirmed Minecraft Specs: Java & Bedrock Support, Paper, Purpur, Fabric, 2 Allocations, 2 Database Access Slots, NVMe Storage, DDoS Protection, Daily Backups Included. **Do NOT claim Forge, NeoForge, or unverified loaders.** Per-plan checkout URLs remain `TODO: ... Paymenter URL` until collected in Phase 8.\n- **B. VPS Hosting \342\200\224 5 Tiers** (`/vps`):\n  - `Root` (4GB | 2 vCPU | 20GB NVMe | `\342\202\271300/mo`), `Branch` (6GB | 2 vCPU | 30GB NVMe | `\342\202\271500/mo`), `Trunk` (8GB | 3 vCPU | 40GB NVMe | `\342\202\271800/mo`), `Canopy` (12GB | 4 vCPU | 60GB NVMe | `\342\202\2711,200/mo`), `Evergrove` (16GB | 4 vCPU | 80GB NVMe | `\342\202\2711,600/mo`).\n  - Specs: KVM Virtualization, Full Root Access, Linux OS, IPv4 Subject to Availability, Network Protection, Discord Support, NVMe Storage, Daily Backups Included.\n  - Infrastructure: AMD Ryzen processors, Intel Xeon Gold processors, DDR5 memory, NVMe storage, Cloudflare protection, DDoS protection (explicitly disclose hardware varies across locations; never invent CPU generations, clock speeds, network speeds, bandwidth, or mitigation Tbps).\n- **C. Free Minecraft Server Rewards** (`/plans#free-rewards`):\n  - `Petal I` (6 invites \342\206\222 2GB), `Petal II` (8 \342\206\222 5GB), `Petal III` (12 \342\206\222 7GB), `Petal IV` (16 \342\206\222 9GB), `Petal V` (20 \342\206\222 13GB), `Petal VI` (30 \342\206\222 17GB). Rules: Member Leave `\342\210\2222`, Rejoin `\342\210\2221`, Fake / Alt Account `\342\210\2222`, Mass Ping `Invite Reset`. Claim via Discord Support Ticket.\n- **D. Discord Boost Rewards** (`/plans#boost-rewards`):\n  - `Bloom I` (1 Boost \342\206\222 3GB), `Bloom II` (2 Boosts \342\206\222 6GB), `Bloom III` (3 Boosts \342\206\222 9GB), `Bloom IV` (4 Boosts \342\206\222 12GB). Specs: Java & Bedrock, NVMe Storage, Claim via Discord Support Ticket, **Active boosts are required to maintain rewards.**\n- **E. Bot Hosting** (`/bots`): Dedicated page with draft botanical tier names (`Pollen (Draft)`, `Dewdrop (Draft)`, `Nectar (Draft)`) clearly badged as awaiting specs/pricing/runtimes (`TODO`), comparison layout, feature cards, Discord & Billing CTAs.\n- **10 Missing Pages**: Documentation (`/docs`), Terms of Service (`/terms`), Privacy Policy (`/privacy`), SLA (`/sla`), Server Locations (`/locations` \342\200\224 Singapore SG, Miami USA, India IN), Contact (`/contact`), About (`/about`), Modpacks (`/modpacks`), VPS Hosting (`/vps`), Bot Hosting (`/bots`).\n- **Procedural Textures Major Upgrade** (`src/three/island/textures.ts` + `src/pages/DevTextures.tsx`), **Button Component Integration** (`StickerButton.tsx`), **SEO + JSON-LD**, **Phase 7 Full Verification**, and **Phase 8**: Ask owner **one question at a time** for remaining missing details at the end alongside the **15-item Final Report**.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Skills Already Read:\n- Earlier session: `ultra-mode`, `frontend-design`, `threejs`, `computer-use`.\n- This session: `/skills/system_skills/applet_seo/SKILL.md` (`applet-seo` \342\200\224 Schema.org JSON-LD, OpenGraph, `window.location.origin + window.location.pathname` canonical tags).\n\n### Completed Work (Phases 1, 2, 6 & Partial Phase 3 \342\200\224 NOT YET COMPILED/TESTED SINCE EDITS):\n1. **Phase 1 Audit Complete**: Inspected `/src/content/index.ts`, `/src/content/content.test.ts`, `/scripts/check-release.ts`, `/src/App.tsx`, `/src/three/island/textures.ts`, `/src/three/island/textures.test.ts`, `/src/pages/DevTextures.tsx`, `/src/components/sketch/StickerButton.tsx`, `/src/sections/plans/*`, `/src/sections/home/*`, `/src/sections/sections.test.tsx`, `/src/components/ui/doodle-crew-footer.tsx`, `/src/components/ui/doodle-crew-footer.test.ts`.\n   - Verified 0 `fetch` / `defineProperty` calls in app code (earlier runtime error was solely user Chrome extension `eppiocemhmnlbhjplcgkofciiegomcon`).\n   - Verified `DoodleCrewFooter` dynamically measures any wordmark (`\"PETALNODES\"`, `letter: 9` for Patch works natively).\n2. **Phase 2 \342\200\224 Centralized Data Updated**:\n   - Created `/src/content/pages.ts` (all copy/TODO markers for `locationsPage`, `docsPage` [10 categories], `modpacksPage`, `aboutPage`, `contactPage`, and draft `legalDocs` [`terms`, `privacy`, `sla`]).\n   - Updated `/src/content/index.ts`: Petalnodes branding, all confirmed URLs, 7 Minecraft plans (`Seed`\342\200\223`Sakura`), `planIncludes` (Java & Bedrock, Paper/Purpur/Fabric, 2 Allocations, 2 DB slots, NVMe, DDoS, Daily Backups), 5 VPS plans (`Root`\342\200\223`Evergrove`), `vpsSection`, `freeRewards` (`Petal I`\342\200\223`VI`), `boostRewards` (`Bloom I`\342\200\223`IV`), `botHosting` (draft tiers), `nav` (`routeItems` + `externalItems` + `ctaLabel: \"Client Area\"`), `story` (updated specs & Paper/Purpur/Fabric loaders only), `trust` (Ryzen & Xeon Gold / SG\302\267Miami\302\267IN / DDoS & Cloudflare / NVMe\302\267Daily Backups), `faq`, `footerConfig` (`PETALNODES`, all requested links across Hosting/Resources/Company/Account, TikTok removed, unverified socials hidden via `!isTodo`), and extended `listTodos()`.\n3. **Phase 6 \342\200\224 Button Integration Updated**:\n   - Upgraded `/src/components/sketch/StickerButton.tsx` with React Router `to` support, `disabled`, `loading`, `loadingText`, `leftIcon`/`rightIcon`, pointer/touch & keyboard (`Space`/`Enter`) press feedback, `aria-busy`/`aria-disabled`, and Petalnodes sketchbook ink borders (no glassmorphism/metallic/neon effects).\n4. **Updated Core Sections & Components**:\n   - `/src/components/layout/Nav.tsx`: Updated to render `Home`, `Minecraft Hosting`, `VPS Hosting`, `Bot Hosting`, `Server Locations`, `Documentation`, `Discord` (external), `Client Area` CTA, plus responsive notebook `Sheet` drawer with `Game Panel` button.\n   - `/src/sections/home/PanelSketch.tsx`: Removed hardcoded `Forge`/`NeoForge`/`Modpacks` assumptions; now reads verified `[\"Paper\", \"Purpur\", \"Fabric\"]` and targets `LOADERS[LOADERS.length - 1]` via `[data-loader-target=\"true\"]`.\n   - `/src/sections/plans/PlanCard.tsx`: Added `\"sakura\"` growth SVG + seed `107`, renders INR pricing (`\342\202\27159/mo` etc.) cleanly.\n   - `/src/sections/plans/PlanGrid.tsx`: Balances 7 cards across tablet/desktop (centered 7th card `Sakura`).\n   - `/src/sections/plans/CompareTable.tsx`: Updated rows for all 7 plans (`RAM`, `CPU`, `Storage`, `Editions: Java & Bedrock`, `Software: Paper, Purpur, Fabric`, `Allocations / DBs`, `DDoS Protection`, `Backups`, `Price`, `Plant` CTA).\n   - `/src/sections/home/TrustStrip.tsx`: Adjusted `TinyWorldMap` pin coordinates for Miami, India, Singapore + cleaner wrapping typography.\n   - `/src/sections/plans/RewardsSection.tsx`: New component rendering `Petal I\342\200\223VI` Invite Rewards + rules box and `Bloom I\342\200\223IV` Boost Rewards + active boost requirement banner.\n   - `/src/pages/Plans.tsx`: Updated with anchor links, `RewardsSection`, and `cherry blossom minecraft hosting` eyebrow.\n5. **Phase 3 Pages Created So Far (4 of 10)**:\n   - `/src/pages/VpsHosting.tsx` (`/vps`)\n   - `/src/pages/BotHosting.tsx` (`/bots`)\n   - `/src/pages/Locations.tsx` (`/locations` \342\200\224 interactive sketchbook SVG world map + SG/Miami/IN cards + infrastructure section)\n   - Also `/src/pages/Plans.tsx` updated.\n\n### Remaining Unbuilt Work:\n- Remaining 7 new pages (`Docs.tsx`, `Modpacks.tsx`, `About.tsx`, `Contact.tsx`, `Terms/Privacy/Sla` via `LegalPage.tsx`).\n- Routing + `<RouteMeta>` SEO/Canonical wiring in `/src/App.tsx`, plus `/index.html` SEO + Schema.org JSON-LD (`Organization`, `WebSite`).\n- `/src/sections/home/PlansHighlight.tsx`: Optional check (currently still has `\"See all seven plans \342\206\222\"` automatically from `plansSection.seeAllLabel`; optionally add subtle `/vps` link).\n- **Phase 4**: Texture quality upgrade in `/src/three/island/textures.ts` + enhanced inspection UI in `/src/pages/DevTextures.tsx` (face breakdown, albedo/normal/roughness preview, lighting control).\n- **Phase 5**: Update `/src/content/content.test.ts` and `/src/sections/sections.test.tsx` (note breaking test expectations detailed below!), add unit tests for VPS/rewards/new pages.\n- **Phase 7**: Full `tsx --test`, `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, `npm run check:release`, production `vite build` tree-shake check, `restart_dev_server` + Playwright visual/DOM/mobile/static verification across ALL routes.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Existing Tests That MUST Be Updated Carefully (Without Weakening Test Rigor!)**:\n  1. `/src/content/content.test.ts` previously asserted:\n     - `plans.map(p => p.id)` equals 6 tiers `[\"seed\",\"sprout\",\"sapling\",\"blossom\",\"grove\",\"orchard\"]` -> must now check 7 tiers including `\"sakura\"` and RAMs `[2, 4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24]`.\n     - `listTodos()` previously asserted `paths.has(\"links.discord\")` and `plans[i].priceMonthly` -> those are now populated with real confirmed values (`https://discord.gg/GS3wuc4HGk`, `\342\202\27159`..`\342\202\271449`)! Update assertion to verify `plans[i].paymenterUrl` is tracked in `listTodos()` + add tests verifying VPS plans (`root..evergrove`), free rewards (`petal-1..6`), boost rewards (`bloom-1..4`), verified URLs, no TikTok, and no Forge/NeoForge claims in active hosting content!\n  2. `/src/sections/sections.test.tsx` previously asserted:\n     - `PlanCard` shows `\"$\342\200\224 /mo\"` and `\"TODO\"` on `sprout` -> `sprout` now has real price `\342\202\27199/mo`! Test real INR rendering (`\342\202\27199`) + `paymenterUrl`, and test a draft/TODO card separately or via mock `Plan` object with `priceMonthly: \"TODO\"`!\n     - `Nav renders ... nav.howItWorksLabel` -> `Nav.tsx` now uses `nav.routeItems` (`Home`, `Minecraft Hosting`, `VPS Hosting`, `Bot Hosting`, `Server Locations`, `Documentation`) + `nav.externalItems` (`Discord`) + `Client Area`! Update Nav SSR test to verify all `nav.routeItems` and `nav.externalItems` and `ctaHref === links.clientArea`.\n- **Forbidden Copy Guardrail**: `content.test.ts` enforces zero occurrences of `/\\b(unleash|elevate|seamless|next-level|cutting-edge|supercharge|revolutionize|empower)\\b/i` across serialized content \342\200\224 never introduce these words into `pages.ts` or new pages!\n- **Vite Dev Server**: Runs with `DISABLE_HMR=true` and `watch: null`, so always run `restart_dev_server` before Playwright verification.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- Earlier session fixed GLSL luma in `SketchEffect.ts`, `emissiveMap` warning in `textures.ts`, Card/Annotation overlap in `Story.tsx`, `PlanCard` stamp position, and `Nav`/CDP screenshot capture.\n- Current turn user request had `TypeError: Cannot set property fetch of #<Window> which has only a getter` in `chrome-extension://eppiocemhmnlbhjplcgkofciiegomcon/...` (confirmed external browser extension conflict; 0 app `fetch` calls exist).\n- No compile/test run has been executed yet after the Phase 2/3/6 writes in this turn \342\200\224 MUST run full suite once Phases 3\342\200\2235 edits are complete.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Workspace: `/app/applet`. All temporary `.playwright-verify` and `.playwright-cli` directories were cleanly deleted prior to this turn.\n- Newly written/edited files currently on disk (uncompiled/untested yet):\n  - `/src/content/pages.ts`\n  - `/src/content/index.ts`\n  - `/src/components/sketch/StickerButton.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/layout/Nav.tsx`\n  - `/src/sections/home/PanelSketch.tsx`\n  - `/src/sections/plans/PlanCard.tsx`\n  - `/src/sections/plans/PlanGrid.tsx`\n  - `/src/sections/plans/CompareTable.tsx`\n  - `/src/sections/plans/RewardsSection.tsx`\n  - `/src/sections/home/TrustStrip.tsx`\n  - `/src/pages/Plans.tsx`\n  - `/src/pages/VpsHosting.tsx`\n  - `/src/pages/BotHosting.tsx`\n  - `/src/pages/Locations.tsx`\n\n## 6. Next Steps (Exact Order of Execution)\n1. **Finish Phase 3 \342\200\224 Create Remaining 6 Missing Pages**:\n   - `/src/pages/Docs.tsx` (`/docs`): Category sidebar/tabs + client-side search filter + expandable articles across all 10 `docsPage.categories`, displaying honest panel/billing/software steps & inline TODO badges where `article.note` contains `TODO`.\n   - `/src/pages/Modpacks.tsx` (`/modpacks`): Verified `Paper`, `Purpur`, `Fabric` cards, setup workflow steps, and `modpacksPage.catalogNotice` (`TODO` banner for unconfirmed Forge/NeoForge/pack catalog).\n   - `/src/pages/About.tsx` (`/about`): Story, 3 core pillars, confirmed infrastructure/locations summary, and `aboutPage.ownerDetailsTodo` badge.\n   - `/src/pages/Contact.tsx` (`/contact`): Support channel cards (`Discord`, `Client Area`, `Game Panel`), plus `TODO` placeholders for official email/support hours (never invent emails/phones).\n   - `/src/pages/LegalPage.tsx` (`/terms`, `/privacy`, `/sla`): Takes `docId: \"terms\" | \"privacy\" | \"sla\"`, renders prominent `DRAFT FOR OWNER REVIEW` banner (`Stamp: \"DRAFT\"`), structured legal sections with inline `todoMarker` callouts.\n2. **Wire All Routes + Dynamic Route SEO / Metadata**:\n   - Update `/src/App.tsx`: Add lazy or direct routes for `/plans`, `/vps`, `/bots`, `/locations`, `/docs`, `/modpacks`, `/about`, `/contact`, `/terms`, `/privacy`, `/sla` (keeping `/dev/sketch`, `/dev/textures` strictly `import.meta.env.DEV` lazy-loaded), and add `<RouteMeta />` updating `document.title`, `meta[name=\"description\"]`, `og:title`, `og:description`, and `<link rel=\"canonical\">` per route (`https://petalnodes.cloud` / `window.location.origin + window.location.pathname`).\n   - Update `/index.html`: Sync `<title>`, `<meta name=\"description\">`, `og:*`, `twitter:*` to `\"Petalnodes \342\200\224 Cherry Blossom Minecraft & VPS Hosting\"` (matching `brand.metaTitle`/`brand.metaDescription`), add `<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://petalnodes.cloud\" />` and `<script type=\"application/ld+json\">` for `Organization` + `WebSite` + `Service` (no invented ratings/prices mismatch!).\n   - Also check `/src/sections/home/Home.tsx` / `PlansHighlight.tsx`: optionally add clean link to `/vps` and rewards below `\"See all seven plans \342\206\222\"`.\n3. **Phase 4 \342\200\224 Procedural Texture Major Quality Upgrade (`/src/three/island/textures.ts` + `/src/pages/DevTextures.tsx`)**:\n   - Upgrade `paintBl