      text: "## PHASE 1 \342\200\224 PETALNODE TODO COMPLETION\n\nBefore making any changes, inspect the entire existing project and identify every remaining TODO in the central content module and throughout the website.\n\nI want you to complete all website TODOs, but you MUST collect the missing information directly from me.\n\n### IMPORTANT: INTERACTIVE QUESTIONING\n\nAsk me exactly ONE question at a time.\n\nDo not show me a huge questionnaire.\n\nFollow this process:\n\n1. Find the first unresolved TODO.\n2. Explain briefly what information is needed and where it will be used.\n3. Ask me one clear question.\n4. Wait for my answer.\n5. Validate my answer.\n6. Save the confirmed value in your working checklist.\n7. Move to the next question.\n\nContinue until all relevant TODOs have been reviewed.\n\n### Information to collect\n\nReview all of these categories:\n\n- Final website domain.\n- Paymenter store URL.\n- Paymenter client area URL.\n- Game panel URL.\n- Discord invite URL.\n- Status page URL.\n- Knowledge base URL.\n- Terms, Privacy and SLA URLs.\n- YouTube, X and TikTok URLs.\n- All six hosting plans:\n  - CPU allocation.\n  - Storage allocation.\n  - Monthly price.\n  - Paymenter purchase URL.\n- NVMe storage confirmation.\n- Daily backup confirmation.\n- Any remaining content, specifications or URL placeholders.\n\nAlso check for missing information in the footer, navigation, FAQs, plan comparison table, CTA buttons and SEO metadata.\n\n### Rules\n\n- Never invent prices, specifications, URLs, reviews or claims.\n- If I don\'t know something, leave it as TODO and continue.\n- If an answer is ambiguous, ask a follow-up question before accepting it.\n- Do not ask questions about information that is already confirmed in the project.\n- Keep all content in the existing central content module.\n- Never hardcode content separately inside components.\n\n### Final verification\n\nAfter all questions are completed:\n\n1. Show me a complete summary of the information I provided.\n2. Ask me to confirm the collected information before applying it.\n3. Update the content module.\n4. Run all relevant tests.\n5. Run `npm run check:release`.\n6. Verify that no real purchase or navigation link is broken.\n7. Report any TODOs that genuinely remain unresolved.\n\nDo not start the next development phase until this phase is complete."
