  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Executing the Strategy**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focused on the implementation phase. I\'ve achieved full codebase visibility and a clear understanding of the project\'s style. I\'m moving forward with a meticulous execution of the defined steps, starting with the creation of the necessary files for the remaining routes. Specifically, I\'m beginning by generating the file for the /docs route.\n\n\n**Designing the UI**\n\nI\'m now deep in UI design, specifically for the category pills and the search filter for articles. I\'m focusing on a sketchbook notebook tab style using clean, rectangular buttons within a responsive grid. I\'m also planning to incorporate a client-side search input that will efficiently filter articles across all 10 categories, offering users flexibility in their browsing. Plus, I\'m thinking of displaying honest step-by-step lists and highlighting to-do notes effectively. I\'m also considering the quick-link cards for other pages.\n\n\n**Constructing New Pages**\n\nI\'m now generating the `/plans`, `/about`, and `/contact` pages. For `/about`, I\'m incorporating the story header, the three core pillars, infrastructure summary badges, and a draft notice card for the owner details. `/contact` is taking shape with support channel cards featuring active stamps, along with honest TODO notes. Lastly, I\'m working on `/legal`, which will handle `/terms`, `/privacy`, and `/sla`, complete with draft banners and notebook-style legal sections with TODO stamps for unconfirmed details. I\'m focusing on creating these files in parallel.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "74QAa7m9Ary7qtsPu5vFqAU"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_13498903485514840757"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import * as React from \\\"react\\\";\\nimport { BookOpen, Check, Search } from \\\"lucide-react\\\";\\nimport { docsPage, isTodo, links } from \\\"@/content\\\";\\nimport {\\n  RoughBox,\\n  RoughUnderline,\\n  Stamp,\\n  StickerButton,\\n  WashiTape,\\n} from \\\"@/components/sketch\\\";\\nimport { cn } from \\\"@/lib/utils\\\";\\n\\nexport default function Docs() {\\n  const [activeCategoryId, setActiveCategoryId] = React.useState<string>(\\n    docsPage.categories[0]?.id ?? \\\"getting-started\\\",\\n  );\\n  const [query, setQuery] = React.useState(\\\"\\\");\\n\\n  const parts = docsPage.heading.split(docsPage.highlightWord);\\n  const normalizedQuery = query.trim().toLowerCase();\\n\\n  const matchingCategories = React.useMemo(() => {\\n    if (!normalizedQuery) {\\n      return docsPage.categories.filter((c) => c.id === activeCategoryId);\\n    }\\n    return docsPage.categories\\n      .map((cat) => ({\\n        ...cat,\\n        articles: cat.articles.filter(\\n          (art) =>\\n            cat.title.toLowerCase().includes(normalizedQuery) ||\\n            cat.description.toLowerCase().includes(normalizedQuery) ||\\n            art.title.toLowerCase().includes(normalizedQuery) ||\\n            art.summary.toLowerCase().includes(normalizedQuery) ||\\n            art.steps.some((s) => s.toLowerCase().includes(normalizedQuery)),\\n        ),\\n      }))\\n      .filter((cat) => cat.articles.length > 0);\\n  }, [activeCategoryId, normalizedQuery]);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-28 pb-16\\\">\\n      <header className=\\\"max-w-2xl mb-10\\\">\\n        <p className=\\\"font-handwriting text-lg font-semibold text-blossom-600 mb-2\\\">\\n          {docsPage.eyebrow}\\n        </p>\\n        <h1 className=\\\"font-display-tight text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl text-ink\\\">\\n          {parts[0]}\\n          <RoughUnderline drawIn>{docsPage.highlightWord}</RoughUnderline>\\n          {parts.slice(1).join(docsPage.highlightWord)}\\n        </h1>\\n        <p className=\\\"mt-5 text-lg text-ink-soft leading-relaxed\\\">\\n          {docsPage.sub}\\n        </p>\\n      </header>\\n\\n      {/* Search bar + quick links */}\\n      <div className=\\\"mb-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"relative w-full md:max-w-md\\\">\\n          <Search\\n            className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-4 w-4 text-ink-soft\\\"\\n            aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n          />\\n          <label htmlFor=\\\"docs-search\\\" className=\\\"sr-only\\\">\\n            Search documentation\\n          </label>\\n          <input\\n            id=\\\"docs-search\\\"\\n            type=\\\"search\\\"\\n            value={query}\\n            onChange={(e) => setQuery(e.target.value)}\\n            placeholder=\\\"Search guides (Paper, Fabric, backups, panel...)\\\"\\n            className=\\\"w-full rounded-sm border-2 border-ink bg-paper px-10 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft/70 shadow-[3px_3px_0_var(--color-ink)] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blossom-400\\\"\\n          />\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap gap-2.5\\\">\\n          <StickerButton href={links.gamePanel} external variant=\\\"outline\\\" size=\\\"sm\\\">\\n            Game Panel\\n          </StickerButton>\\n          <StickerButton href={links.clientArea} external variant=\\\"outline\\\" size=\\\"sm\\\">\\n            Client Area\\n          </StickerButton>\\n          <StickerButton href={links.status} external variant=\\\"outline\\\" size=\\\"sm\\\">\\n            Status\\n          </StickerButton>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Sidebar + Articles */}\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start\\\">\\n        <aside aria-label=\\\"Documentation categories\\\" className=\\\"lg:col-span-4\\\">\\n          <RoughBox\\n            seed={1010}\\n            bgClassName=\\\"bg-paper-shade\\\"\\n            padding=\\\"p-4\\\"\\n            className=\\\"shadow-[4px_5px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\"\\n          >\\n            <p className=\\\"font-handwriting text-sm font-bold text-blossom-600 px-2 mb-3\\\">\\n              10 topics \302\267 pick a chapter\\n            </p>\\n            <nav className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1 gap-2\\\">\\n              {docsPage.categories.map((cat, idx) => {\\n                const active = !normalizedQuery && cat.id === activeCategoryId;\\n                return (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={cat.id}\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      setQuery(\\\"\\\");\\n                      setActiveCategoryId(cat.id);\\n                    }}\\n                    className={cn(\\n                      \\\"w-full text-left px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-sm border-2 transition-colors cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between gap-2\\\",\\n                      active\\n                        ? \\\"border-ink bg-blossom-100 text-ink shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--color-ink)] font-bold\\\"\\n                        : \\\"border-ink/25 bg-paper text-ink-soft hover:border-ink hover:text-ink font-semibold\\\",\\n                    )}\\n                  >\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-sm\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"font-pixel text-xs text-blossom-600 mr-2\\\">\\n                        {String(idx + 1).padStart(2, \\\"0\\\")}\\n                      </span>\\n                      {cat.title}\\n                    </span>\\n                    <BookOpen className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 opacity-70\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                  </button>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </nav>\\n          </RoughBox>\\n        </aside>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"lg:col-span-8 space-y-8\\\">\\n          {matchingCategories.length === 0 ? (\\n            <RoughBox\\n              seed={1030}\\n              bgClassName=\\\"bg-paper\\\"\\n              padding=\\\"p-8\\\"\\n              className=\\\"shadow-[4px_4px_0_var(--color-ink)] text-center\\\"\\n            >\\n              <p className=\\\"font-display-tight text-2xl text-ink\\\">\\n                No matching guide found\\n              </p>\\n              <p className=\\\"mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft\\\">\\n                Try clearing your search or ask our support team on Discord.\\n              </p>\\n              <div className=\\\"mt-5 flex justify-center gap-3\\\">\\n                <StickerButton onClick={() => setQuery(\\\"\\\")} variant=\\\"outline\\\" size=\\\"sm\\\">\\n                  Clear search\\n                </StickerButton>\\n                <StickerButton href={links.discord} external variant=\\\"primary\\\" size=\\\"sm\\\">\\n                  Ask on Discord\\n                </StickerButton>\\n              </div>\\n            </RoughBox>\\n          ) : (\\n            matchingCategories.map((cat, cIdx) => (\\n              <section key={cat.id} aria-labelledby={`doc-cat-${cat.id}`} className=\\\"space-y-5\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"border-b-2 border-dashed border-paper-line pb-3\\\">\\n                  <h2\\n                    id={`doc-cat-${cat.id}`}\\n                    className=\\\"font-display-tight text-3xl text-ink\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    {cat.title}\\n                  </h2>\\n                  <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-soft\\\">{cat.description}</p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {cat.articles.map((article, aIdx) => (\\n                  <article key={article.id} className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-2.5 left-6 z-20\\\">\\n                      <WashiTape\\n                        rotation={(cIdx + aIdx) % 2 === 0 ? -3 : 3}\\n                        length={74}\\n                      />\\n                    </div>\\n                    <RoughBox\\n                      seed={1050 + cIdx * 10 + aIdx}\\n                      bgClassName=\\\"bg-paper\\\"\\n                      padding=\\\"p-6 pt-7\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"shadow-[4px_5px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <h3 className=\\\"font-display-tight text-2xl text-ink\\\">\\n                        {article.title}\\n                      </h3>\\n                      <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-ink-soft\\\">{article.summary}</p>\\n\\n                      <ol className=\\\"mt-5 space-y-3 border-t border-dashed border-paper-line pt-4\\\">\\n                        {article.steps.map((step, sIdx) => (\\n                          <li key={sIdx} className=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ink\\\">\\n                            <span className=\\\"mt-0.5 inline-flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-ink bg-moss/15 font-pixel text-xs text-ink\\\">\\n                              {sIdx + 1}\\n                            </span>\\n                            <span className=\\\"leading-relaxed\\\">{step}</span>\\n                          </li>\\n                        ))}\\n                      </ol>\\n\\n                      {article.note && (\\n                        <div className=\\\"mt-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-sm border border-ink/40 bg-blossom-50 px-4 py-3 text-xs text-ink\\\">\\n                          <div className=\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n                            <Check className=\\\"h-4 w-4 text-blossom-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                            <span>{article.note}</span>\\n                          </div>\\n                          {isTodo(article.note) && (\\n                            <Stamp text=\\\"TODO\\\" rotation={-4} size=\\\"sm\\\" className=\\\"shrink-0 bg-paper\\\" />\\n                          )}\\n                        </div>\\n                      )}\\n                    </RoughBox>\\n                  </article>\\n                ))}\\n              </section>\\n            ))\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create Documentation knowledge base page across 10 topics with client-side search filter and honest TODO markers\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/pages/Docs.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating Docs page\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Docs.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\360\026\n\355\026\001i\024}\023_\002\336WT\275:\312\305#N\242\263$(\257\034\323\'\024\t\026\265\302\237h\025A\016\371Z6*\017\"(Q\306\234o\\\243\202\334k\020u\312\217\277\205\025\033N)I\254\307q\303\376\002w\370Z\257\372\203\006V{\3378-f\324MB\272\3022_6F\2256\371O \035\245o\340\343\272\337\247\265\326\035S\3246\236\265\216O\246B\177O\371\032\233\325\020a\225\3533\223\242\354\'k;\bN\334\305s^?1U\2447\322\326\r\237t9~\0069A:\322\333\270\366\337\303\353\324\275\036\262q\036`\032o\330\331\002\231\273y\316s\314E42\250>:.6=3\250\237\243\006\371^\215\371\271\236M\000D\216\223&\364\341R#r\016\026\300\371\327\305\313\234x\210\2562\250\222\3227NC\026\032\242\362\037\003\n`\0014\000P.\242\327,CI\337\200H\332w\320\240.>t2\374\2348\210\002mkV\247[6t\337k\354\254\251T\205M\333\324k\024Ty\316}\313\230\202\355<\035\300\315`)\340\346\231\302\231\315\024\020\365S\\X\212\352\234K\202\205\315\313\202\360\022\327\204\305\020\324s\361\202i\2675\304@\306\016\311\231g\251\3277\332?\352.\271\273w\322\023\371\242\361\201\302TuGJ\332U\276\306\000\346\326\204\342\256\226\204\277\3434~Z\ve`)tn\326\257\005F\220\233z\023\264\354t\032\352\244y:u(\2445\217z\311\325rO\364\272cd\\R\267Y\360\336\021]K$<\261\305\221\035x`\260\324k\351g\355\213\2030\335f\372W|\340\343\234\\\335\261\264\274\331~\024\244\323\320\343\377\234\371V\260\277\350\265NL\233\257\026w\356m\016T$\266@\270\232\363\271.u\215\021\320\204\276\tU\316u\223\004\026&(\'/\277\a\277\375\203\030D\v\3716\330\030\251g\223\031\367H\276\246\2549i\303\336\250\3719\360|l\370$I\234l\277\037q\315\311\270S\3343\005\342+ax\235\323\263w8\034H\177\250b\214\206F\027\341\b]\273\325\250V\225\210^h\224\246\227>E\205eT\347\230\321\2744g\323\030\347\33383\314\356\213\235\221\vp^\317\357.\342\241\323\210\260M\223I?A2\215\rM\244\36297\364\265_\027\t\211\004)\276\244\347\304\3743\351\265\351\360co\363\342\332\361\302\370\372\016\3233|Z3|\252T\202\2040\323\330\221*J&g\354\227\344Y#\260\254\374p{\256\2432r\333\025\247B\277b:\320\233\