  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Test Coverage**\n\nI\'m now diving into updating and expanding the unit and SSR tests, focusing on `/src/content/content.test.ts`, `/src/sections/sections.test.tsx`, and `/src/three/island/textures.test.ts`. My key concern is ensuring these tests comprehensively verify the functionality within those files.\n\n\n**Verifying Content Data**\n\nI\'ve just added detailed tests for the content data within `content.test.ts`. I\'m specifically verifying the accuracy and order of Minecraft tiers, VPS plans (including RAM and pricing), and free invite/Discord boost rewards. I\'ve also verified key links, and confirmed the absence of certain deprecated terms. I\'m checking that the `listTodos()` function handles all existing `TODO` placeholders.\n\n\n**Validating Forbidden Terms**\n\nI\'m now focused on validating the content data within `/src/content/content.test.ts` and `/src/sections/sections.test.tsx`. I\'ve added tests to ensure that no forbidden AI words appear in any content objects, including `pages.ts`. Further, I\'m checking the content for accuracy and that key links are properly rendered. SSR tests are now fully expanded and cover all new pages and sections.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "YoUAa_6ZOeHUz7IPpdWPoA4"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4565894983759206475"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import test from \\\"node:test\\\";\\nimport assert from \\\"node:assert/strict\\\";\\nimport {\\n  aboutPage,\\n  boostRewards,\\n  botHosting,\\n  brand,\\n  contactPage,\\n  docsPage,\\n  faq,\\n  footerConfig,\\n  freeRewards,\\n  highlightPlanIds,\\n  legalDocs,\\n  links,\\n  listTodos,\\n  locationsPage,\\n  modpacksPage,\\n  nav,\\n  planIncludes,\\n  plans,\\n  plansSection,\\n  story,\\n  trust,\\n  vpsPlans,\\n  vpsSection,\\n} from \\\"./index\\\";\\n\\ntest(\\\"plans has seven Cherry Blossom tiers in exact order seed..sakura\\\", () => {\\n  assert.deepEqual(\\n    plans.map((p) => p.id),\\n    [\\\"seed\\\", \\\"sprout\\\", \\\"sapling\\\", \\\"blossom\\\", \\\"grove\\\", \\\"orchard\\\", \\\"sakura\\\"],\\n  );\\n  assert.deepEqual(\\n    plans.map((p) => p.ramGb),\\n    [2, 4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24],\\n  );\\n  assert.deepEqual(\\n    plans.map((p) => p.priceMonthly),\\n    [\\\"\342\202\27159\\\", \\\"\342\202\27199\\\", \\\"\342\202\271169\\\", \\\"\342\202\271239\\\", \\\"\342\202\271299\\\", \\\"\342\202\271369\\\", \\\"\342\202\271449\\\"],\\n  );\\n});\\n\\ntest(\\\"exactly one plan is ourPick and it is sapling\\\", () => {\\n  const picks = plans.filter((p) => p.ourPick);\\n  assert.equal(picks.length, 1);\\n  assert.equal(picks[0].id, \\\"sapling\\\");\\n});\\n\\ntest(\\\"highlightPlanIds are sprout, sapling, blossom and all exist\\\", () => {\\n  assert.deepEqual(highlightPlanIds, [\\\"sprout\\\", \\\"sapling\\\", \\\"blossom\\\"]);\\n  const ids = new Set(plans.map((p) => p.id));\\n  for (const id of highlightPlanIds) {\\n    assert.ok(ids.has(id));\\n  }\\n});\\n\\ntest(\\\"vpsPlans has five tiers root..evergrove with confirmed specs and INR pricing\\\", () => {\\n  assert.deepEqual(\\n    vpsPlans.map((p) => p.id),\\n    [\\\"root\\\", \\\"branch\\\", \\\"trunk\\\", \\\"canopy\\\", \\\"evergrove\\\"],\\n  );\\n  assert.deepEqual(\\n    vpsPlans.map((p) => p.ramGb),\\n    [4, 6, 8, 12, 16],\\n  );\\n  assert.deepEqual(\\n    vpsPlans.map((p) => p.priceMonthly),\\n    [\\\"\342\202\271300\\\", \\\"\342\202\271500\\\", \\\"\342\202\271800\\\", \\\"\342\202\2711,200\\\", \\\"\342\202\2711,600\\\"],\\n  );\\n});\\n\\ntest(\\\"freeRewards and boostRewards match confirmed Petal and Bloom tiers\\\", () => {\\n  assert.deepEqual(\\n    freeRewards.tiers.map((t) => [t.name, t.invitesRequired, t.ramGb]),\\n    [\\n      [\\\"Petal I\\\", 6, 2],\\n      [\\\"Petal II\\\", 8, 5],\\n      [\\\"Petal III\\\", 12, 7],\\n      [\\\"Petal IV\\\", 16, 9],\\n      [\\\"Petal V\\\", 20, 13],\\n      [\\\"Petal VI\\\", 30, 17],\\n    ],\\n  );\\n  assert.deepEqual(\\n    boostRewards.tiers.map((t) => [t.name, t.boostsRequired, t.ramGb]),\\n    [\\n      [\\\"Bloom I\\\", 1, 3],\\n      [\\\"Bloom II\\\", 2, 6],\\n      [\\\"Bloom III\\\", 3, 9],\\n      [\\\"Bloom IV\\\", 4, 12],\\n    ],\\n  );\\n});\\n\\ntest(\\\"confirmed URLs are set, TikTok is absent, and unverified loaders are excluded\\\", () => {\\n  assert.equal(links.siteUrl, \\\"https://petalnodes.cloud\\\");\\n  assert.equal(links.store, \\\"https://billing.petalnodes.cloud\\\");\\n  assert.equal(links.clientArea, \\\"https://billing.petalnodes.cloud\\\");\\n  assert.equal(links.gamePanel, \\\"https://panel.petalnodes.cloud\\\");\\n  assert.equal(links.discord, \\\"https://discord.gg/GS3wuc4HGk\\\");\\n  assert.equal(links.status, \\\"https://status.petalnodes.cloud\\\");\\n\\n  const socialLabels = links.socials.map((s) => s.label.toLowerCase());\\n  assert.ok(!socialLabels.includes(\\\"tiktok\\\"));\\n\\n  const planIncludesText = planIncludes.join(\\\" \\\");\\n  assert.ok(!/\\\\b(forge|neoforge)\\\\b/i.test(planIncludesText));\\n});\\n\\ntest(\\\"listTodos tracks remaining unconfirmed URLs, bot draft specs, and legal review markers\\\", () => {\\n  const todos = listTodos();\\n  const paths = new Set(todos.map((t) => t.path));\\n  for (let i = 0; i < plans.length; i++) {\\n    assert.ok(paths.has(`plans[${i}].paymenterUrl`));\\n  }\\n  for (let i = 0; i < vpsPlans.length; i++) {\\n    assert.ok(paths.has(`vpsPlans[${i}].paymenterUrl`));\\n  }\\n  assert.ok(paths.has(\\\"links.socials[0].href\\\"));\\n  assert.ok(paths.has(\\\"botHosting.supportedRuntimesTodo\\\"));\\n  assert.ok(paths.has(\\\"legalDocs.terms.lastUpdated\\\"));\\n});\\n\\ntest(\\\"no content string contains a forbidden copy word\\\", () => {\\n  const forbidden =\\n    /\\\\b(unleash|elevate|seamless|next-level|cutting-edge|supercharge|revolutionize|empower)\\\\b/i;\\n  const serialized = JSON.stringify({\\n    brand,\\n    planIncludes,\\n    plans,\\n    vpsPlans,\\n    vpsSection,\\n    freeRewards,\\n    boostRewards,\\n    botHosting,\\n    nav,\\n    story,\\n    plansSection,\\n    trust,\\n    faq,\\n    footerColumns: footerConfig.columns,\\n    locationsPage,\\n    docsPage,\\n    modpacksPage,\\n    aboutPage,\\n    contactPage,\\n    legalDocs,\\n  });\\n  assert.equal(forbidden.test(serialized), false);\\n});\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update content unit tests to verify 7 Minecraft tiers, 5 VPS tiers, Petal/Bloom rewards, confirmed URLs, and zero forbidden copy words\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/content/content.test.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating content unit tests\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update content.test.ts\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\354\034\n\351\034\001i\024}\023C\276\342\241\344I\312t\356|\345\254\2008\261T\300\212\211\257\2055\270L\2039V\b#cf\240\017\026:\300\342g \031\005\226\317\314\210\321\251\023\317zb\f\310\033|\312\243?\275m\204`O\320\311\363\3114$b\235\337N\0020\351\220\025\232P|\301d\244\'n]SX\324;\264\251\240{\377\336\001\276\023\\\233\333g\025\345\226\244\307T\031V\035s\313\325\236\a\363\021\333\237Q`1\33326\254\023D\367W\270}\026\315\232\205|\033\360a-\310\317\277\304\324\236\265\205G\3512\311\244\336\247G\207\275\235\365\aa\253.K\360\236=&\213\367\343N\242\343\221a\000AQ*%2\276,\304K0\205s3\234\211J\342\361\335\220\364\202\206L^\255\021\362\016mr\025\210B\317\256o\250~b\256O\317\272ao\331Y5\273lV,\026\2218\350\324;\244V\251\246\227|\204m\347\374\236\2129\361*\032\350\316.\375\\\004 \334\270I\363$\231?\211\274\256%{\322\\\217h\357\357Bq\301\266\335w\031]\353\264\204D]w*V\257O\3034i\315^\351I\255^_\270c\306\311h\337\"\245\245\352\327\303\373\355\2536\302^Y\324?\036\350\371GR\222t$c\240\037\3363\277\v\224\\\300\232\215t\265\036\243d\347F\222$\256\2423X .\006\v\023\376\230\371U&\374\001\213\316\366\\Np3\241 [\016\"\377!T5\034\373\037\036!\031\203bd\236\354j\354,gN:\207W\004\211\342IE\321\223Rb\021\"\204\225e2\235\236\250\336K\026K\254t\034\200\247\261-\003\331\340:\203\2212\036.\020\213\326\a\304\271/\022\273\365\327^/\006\371\250\326\273R\270\214\316\025x>\357\330v\275\244\206\202{\236r\374\225\316\r\220\"\302\'\325\n\021\240\240\270\f\310$\360my@Z\370g+\2254G>(\302S6B>\2669i`\325N\343\345\313\223\307ZK\001\346\255h\267\353O\255\227\303\255^|\365\020\224)\017{\2117H\332\356\352\350\351\vb~\373b\206Q\274|N\272\003\376\243\v\333U\210\340\261\030\274\233\277\342\277\2429\310\236/KAy\323\255\005\'[}\355\264\327\354\357\314^\305\fb@*\247\3001{\215\b2\262\311\232\236\017_i;L\335\305\200\377m/\017\f/\301\313*a\375\366\370\000\205fG\226\365\320=\026\336\240\\m\"\314\245\006\377\204\214I\017\235#\304Z\217\317.\354\nke\277\016Z\220\356\232k\333\220k@\350\370K\2