  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Discovering Error Sources**\n\nI\'m thrilled with the initial results! Inspecting both DOM layout and visual screenshots proved immediately insightful. The browser check revealed zero console or page errors across all 14 tests, which is a great starting point for deeper investigation.\n\n\n**Analyzing Visual Cohesion**\n\nI\'m incredibly pleased with the visual harmony I\'m observing! The sketchbook design, typography, color palette, and SVG map all contribute to a very clean look. I\'m especially happy with the Sapling card and the nav bar\'s cohesion. I am thrilled at the work I\'m performing! I am now focused on a couple of real defects Playwright caught.\n\nI have found a horizontal overflow on mobile for `/plans` and `/bots`. `/plans` has scrollWidth of 412 compared to 390! On `/vps` scrollWidth is 390 (zero overflow), despite it also using tilted cards and a comparison table. I am comparing `/src/pages/Plans.tsx`, `/src/sections/plans/PlanGrid.tsx`, `/src/sections/plans/RewardsSection.tsx`, `/src/sections/plans/CompareTable.tsx`, and `/src/pages/BotHosting.tsx`. On `/bots`, the \"Proposed Botanical Tiers\" are sticking out.\n\n\n"
