  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Inspecting Textures\' Layout**\n\nOkay, I\'ve been examining `dev-textures.png` and I think I\'m onto something big! That visual inspection was key. I\'m focusing on the `grass` block, specifically its side faces. It seems Three.js has the green grass strip at the *bottom* of the side faces. That\'s a curious detail that warrants further investigation, as I compare this against the `side`...\n\n\n**Uncovering the Flips**\n\nI\'ve made a breakthrough. The 2D canvas swatch places grass at the top, a crucial detail. I realized Three.js\'s `DataTexture` has `flipY = false` by default! This means the y-axis is inverted compared to what I expected. Setting `flipY = true` fixes the issue, aligning the grass\'s green overhang at the top, and inverting stems to the correct orientation. It was right there in the `/dev/textures` WebGL render!\n\n\n"
    message_id: "R4YAa8GmGqjpz7IP5f2n8As"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9828200871348984274"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Set tex.flipY = true on procedural DataTextures so y=0 (grass overhang, sapling/flower top) maps to the top edge of 3D block faces\", \"EndLine\":636, \"Instruction\":\"Add tex.flipY = true inside makeDataTexture in src/three/island/textures.ts\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"function makeDataTexture(data: Uint8Array, isColor: boolean): THREE.DataTexture {\\n  const tex = new THREE.DataTexture(data, SIZE, SIZE, THREE.RGBAFormat);\\n  tex.colorSpace = isColor ? THREE.SRGBColorSpace : THREE.NoColorSpace;\\n  tex.flipY = true;\\n  tex.magFilter = THREE.NearestFilter;\\n  tex.minFilter = THREE.LinearMipmapLinearFilter;\\n  tex.generateMipmaps = true;\\n  tex.wrapS = THREE.RepeatWrapping;\\n  tex.wrapT = THREE.RepeatWrapping;\\n  tex.needsUpdate = true;\\n  return tex;\\n}\", \"StartLine\":622, \"TargetContent\":\"function makeDataTexture(data: Uint8Array, isColor: boolean): THREE.DataTexture {\\n  const tex = new THREE.DataTexture(data, SIZE, SIZE, THREE.RGBAFormat);\\n  tex.colorSpace = isColor ? THREE.SRGBColorSpace : THREE.NoColorSpace;\\n  tex.magFilter = THREE.NearestFilter;\\n  tex.minFilter = THREE.LinearMipmapLinearFilter;\\n  tex.generateMipmaps = true;\\n  tex.wrapS = THREE.RepeatWrapping;\\n  tex.wrapT = THREE.RepeatWrapping;\\n  tex.needsUpdate = true;\\n  return tex;\\n}\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/three/island/textures.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Fixing DataTexture flipY orientation in textures.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Fix grass DataTexture orientation\"}"
