  planner_response {
    response: "The **Petalnodes** website update is complete, verified, and running cleanly across desktop and mobile viewports.\n\n---\n\n### Summary of Completed Updates\n\n1. **Brand Identity & Verified URLs**\n   - Brand updated to **Petalnodes** (`PETALNODES` footer wordmark) with verified links wired across navigation, buttons, and footer:\n     - **Website:** `https://petalnodes.cloud`\n     - **Billing / Store & Client Area:** `https://billing.petalnodes.cloud`\n     - **Game Panel:** `https://panel.petalnodes.cloud`\n     - **Discord:** `https://discord.gg/GS3wuc4HGk`\n     - **Status:** `https://status.petalnodes.cloud`\n   - TikTok is omitted everywhere; unverified YouTube (`Petalnodes`), X (`@petalnodes`), and Instagram (`@petalnodes`) links remain flagged `TODO` and hidden from the footer until exact URLs are confirmed.\n   - Official Mojang disclaimer preserved verbatim.\n\n2. **Minecraft Hosting \342\200\224 7 Cherry Blossom Tiers (`/plans`)**\n   - Replaced legacy plan names with the complete 7-tier Cherry Blossom lineup:\n     - **Seed:** 2GB RAM \302\267 100% CPU \302\267 10GB NVMe \302\267 `\342\202\27159/mo`\n     - **Sprout:** 4GB RAM \302\267 150% CPU \302\267 15GB NVMe \302\267 `\342\202\27199/mo`\n     - **Sapling (`OUR PICK`):** 8GB RAM \302\267 250% CPU \302\267 25GB NVMe \302\267 `\342\202\271169/mo`\n     - **Blossom:** 12GB RAM \302\267 350% CPU \302\267 35GB NVMe \302\267 `\342\202\271239/mo`\n     - **Grove:** 16GB RAM \302\267 400% CPU \302\267 45GB NVMe \302\267 `\342\202\271299/mo`\n     - **Orchard:** 20GB RAM \302\267 500% CPU \302\267 55GB NVMe \302\267 `\342\202\271369/mo`\n     - **Sakura:** 24GB RAM \302\267 600% CPU \302\267 65GB NVMe \302\267 `\342\202\271449/mo`\n   - Confirmed inclusions across plans: Java & Bedrock Support, Paper, Purpur & Fabric, 2 Allocations, 2 Database Access Slots, NVMe Storage, DDoS Protection, and Daily Backups Included. Unverified loaders (Forge, NeoForge) were removed from active hosting copy.\n   - Updated the comparison table and interactive `PanelSketch` preview (`Paper`, `Purpur`, `Fabric`).\n\n3. **VPS Hosting \342\200\224 5 Tiers (`/vps`)**\n   - **Root** (4GB, 2 vCPU, 20GB NVMe, `\342\202\271300/mo`), **Branch** (6GB, 2 vCPU, 30GB NVMe, `\342\202\271500/mo`), **Trunk** (8GB, 3 vCPU, 40GB NVMe, `\342\202\271800/mo`), **Canopy** (12GB, 4 vCPU, 60GB NVMe, `\342\202\2711,200/mo`), and **Evergrove** (16GB, 4 vCPU, 80GB NVMe, `\342\202\2711,600/mo`).\n   - Displays KVM Virtualization, Full Root Access, Linux OS, IPv4 Subject to Availability, Network Protection, Discord Support, NVMe Storage, Daily Backups Included, plus honest hardware disclosures (AMD Ryzen & Intel Xeon Gold processors, DDR5, NVMe, Cloudflare & DDoS protection, varying by location).\n\n4. **Free Minecraft Server & Discord Boost Rewards (`/plans#free-rewards`, `/plans#boost-rewards`)**\n   - **Petal I \342\200\223 VI** Invite Rewards (`6 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 20 / 30` invites \342\206\222 `2GB / 5GB / 7GB / 9GB / 13GB / 17GB`) with documented integrity rules (`Member Leave \342\210\2222`, `Rejoin \342\210\2221`, `Fake / Alt \342\210\2222`, `Mass Ping Invite Reset`).\n   - **Bloom I \342\200\223 IV** Discord Boost Rewards (`1 / 2 / 3 / 4` active boosts \342\206\222 `3GB / 6GB / 9GB / 12GB`) noting Java & Bedrock, NVMe Storage, Discord Ticket claim flow, and the requirement to keep active boosts to maintain rewards.\n\n5. **Bot Hosting (`/bots`)**\n   - Built with draft botanical tier cards (**Pollen (Draft)**, **Dewdrop (Draft)**, **Nectar (Draft)**), clear `TODO` badges, comparison layout, and Discord/Billing CTAs without inventing unconfirmed specs or prices.\n\n6. **10 New Pages, Navigation, SEO & Sketchbook Button Upgrade**\n   - Added `/vps`, `/bots`, `/locations` (interactive SVG map for Singapore, Miami, and India), `/docs` (10 searchable knowledge-base categories), `/modpacks` (verified Paper/Purpur/Fabric + `TODO` catalog notice), `/about`, `/contact`, `/terms`, `/privacy`, and `/sla` (all legal pages clearly marked as Drafts pending owner review).\n   - Upgraded `StickerButton` with React Router `to` support, `disabled`, `loading`/`loadingText`, icon slots, and keyboard (`Enter`/`Space`) press feedback.\n   - Configured per-route `<title>`, `<meta name=\"description\">`, OpenGraph/Twitter tags, `<link rel=\"canonical\">`, and Schema.org JSON-LD (`Organization` + `WebSite`).\n\n7. **Procedural PBR Block Textures (`/dev/textures`)**\n   - Upgraded all 14 procedural `64\303\22764` block textures with Worley cellular patterns, domain-warped FBM, 3\303\2273 Sobel normal maps, paired roughness maps, and corrected Three.js `DataTexture.flipY = true` UV orientation so grass overhangs, woodgrain, bark lenticels, crystals, and flora render upright in 3D.\n   - Expanded `/dev/textures` with side/top albedo, normal, and roughness 2D pixel swatches plus Daylight / Sunset / Lantern lighting toggles.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Results\n\n- **Unit & SSR Tests (`tsx --test`):** **38 / 38 passing** (`content.test.ts`, `sections.test.tsx`, `textures.test.ts`, `islandGenerator.test.ts`, `doodle-crew-footer.test.ts`).\n- **Build & Typecheck (`compile_applet` + `lint_applet` / `tsc --noEmit`):** Succeeded with 0 errors; production Vite build cleanly tree-shakes dev-only routes and `DevTodoBadge`.\n- **Headless Chromium Verification (`playwright-cli`):** Verified desktop (`1440\303\227900`) and mobile (`390\303\227844`) across all routes with **0 console/page errors** and **0 horizontal overflow**, and confirmed interactive Docs search and corrected grass cube UV alignment on `/dev/textures`.\n- **Remaining TODOs Tracked by `npm run check:release` (57 items):** 18 blocking URLs (7 Minecraft Paymenter checkout URLs, 5 VPS Paymenter URLs, 3 Bot Hosting URLs, and 3 unverified social profile URLs) plus 39 unconfirmed draft details (Bot Hosting specs/runtimes, support email/hours, backup retention, provisioning/upgrade/refund rules, Geyser port guide, and legal entity/jurisdiction/SLA targets).\n\n---\n\n### Question 1 of Remaining Details\n\nTo wire direct checkout buttons for the **Minecraft Hosting** plans, please share the **Paymenter checkout/product URL** for **Seed** (`2GB RAM`, `\342\202\27159/mo`) \342\200\224 or reply with all seven Minecraft Paymenter URLs (`Seed`, `Sprout`, `Sapling`, `Blossom`, `Grove`, `Orchard`, `Sakura`) if you have them ready, or say `\"skip\"` if they aren\'t created yet."
    thinking: "**Verifying Output Readiness**\n\nI\'ve completed the build and verification process. Everything is compiled, passes linting and unit tests, and has been tree-shaken for production. I have also verified the visual output across desktop and mobile resolutions in headless Chromium. I am now reviewing the Phase 8 instructions to ensure I deliver on their requirements.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "f4YAa-TBAtvVz7IPzv_vmA4"
