  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Texture Comparisons**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `/dev/textures` page and the task of presenting side-by-side comparisons of original and newly processed textures. Specifically, I\'m thinking about how best to display the flat originals versus the normal-mapped and height-mapped versions. The requirements are guiding the approach; I need to find the optimal visual presentation for this comparison.\n\n\n**Refining Presentation Details**\n\nI\'ve been working on refining the presentation details for texture comparisons, specifically for stone, deep stone, and cherry log variations. I\'m introducing a surface grain intensity toggle with subtle, balanced, and rich options. Height map channel swatches will also be displayed. I\'ve noticed the WebGL context constraints and confirmed that using one `<Canvas>` for both original and new textures keeps the context count low. I\'ve also verified that the existing configuration cleanly uses the `aoMap` without needing `uv2`. I need to review spinning block geometry usage.\n\n\n**Implementing User Interface Controls**\n\nI\'m now focused on the user interface controls within `DevTextures.tsx`. I\'m introducing a `Compare: Side-by-Side | PBR Only` toggle, to give users more control over the texture comparisons. This complements existing toggles like grain intensity, tier, and lighting. I\'m also ensuring that texture swatches dynamically update based on the `grainIntensity` parameter, impacting the `albedo`, `normal`, `roughness`, and `heightMap` swatches. I\'m also adding a height map swatch when `usesHeightMapRelief(type)` is true, with a visual indicator (\"normal + height\" or \"normal\") on the card.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "DokAa5THMPWhz7IPqfTTyQs"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1036023840614101909"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import * as React from \\\"react\\\";\\nimport * as THREE from \\\"three\\\";\\nimport { Canvas, useFrame } from \\\"@react-three/fiber\\\";\\nimport { BLOCK_TYPES, type BlockType } from \\\"@/three/island/islandGenerator\\\";\\nimport {\\n  getBlockMaterial,\\n  paintBlockBuffers,\\n  usesHeightMapRelief,\\n  type BlockFace,\\n  type MaterialVariant,\\n} from \\\"@/three/island/textures\\\";\\nimport type { QualityTier } from \\\"@/lib/quality\\\";\\nimport { cn } from \\\"@/lib/utils\\\";\\n\\ntype LightMode = \\\"daylight\\\" | \\\"sunset\\\" | \\\"lantern\\\";\\n\\nconst GRAIN_PRESETS = [\\n  { id: \\\"subtle\\\", label: \\\"Subtle 0.5\303\227\\\", value: 0.5 },\\n  { id: \\\"balanced\\\", label: \\\"Balanced 1.0\303\227\\\", value: 1.0 },\\n  { id: \\\"rich\\\", label: \\\"Rich 1.8\303\227\\\", value: 1.8 },\\n] as const;\\n\\nfunction SpinningBlock({\\n  type,\\n  tier,\\n  variant,\\n  grainIntensity,\\n  position = [0, 0, 0],\\n  size = 1.38,\\n}: {\\n  type: BlockType;\\n  tier: QualityTier;\\n  variant: MaterialVariant;\\n  grainIntensity: number;\\n  position?: [number, number, number];\\n  size?: number;\\n}) {\\n  const meshRef = React.useRef<THREE.Mesh | null>(null);\\n  const materials = React.useMemo(() => {\\n    return getBlockMaterial(type, tier, false, { variant, grainIntensity });\\n  }, [type, tier, variant, grainIntensity]);\\n\\n  useFrame((_, delta) => {\\n    if (meshRef.current) {\\n      meshRef.current.rotation.y += delta * 0.65;\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  return (\\n    <mesh\\n      ref={meshRef}\\n      position={position}\\n      rotation={[0.42, 0.65, 0]}\\n      material={materials}\\n    >\\n      <boxGeometry args={[size, size, size]} />\\n    </mesh>\\n  );\\n}\\n\\nfunction TextureSwatch({\\n  type,\\n  face,\\n  channel,\\n  label,\\n  grainIntensity,\\n}: {\\n  type: BlockType;\\n  face: BlockFace;\\n  channel: \\\"albedo\\\" | \\\"normal\\\" | \\\"roughness\\\" | \\\"heightMap\\\";\\n  label: string;\\n  grainIntensity: number;\\n}) {\\n  const canvasRef = React.useRef<HTMLCanvasElement | null>(null);\\n\\n  React.useEffect(() => {\\n    const canvas = canvasRef.current;\\n    if (!canvas) return;\\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext(\\\"2d\\\");\\n    if (!ctx) return;\\n\\n    const bufs = paintBlockBuffers(type, face, { grainIntensity });\\n    const data = bufs[channel];\\n    const img = ctx.createImageData(64, 64);\\n    img.data.set(data);\\n    ctx.putImageData(img, 0, 0);\\n  }, [type, face, channel, grainIntensity]);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1\\\">\\n      <canvas\\n        ref={canvasRef}\\n        width={64}\\n        height={64}\\n        style={{ imageRendering: \\\"pixelated\\\" }}\\n        className=\\\"h-10 w-10 border border-ink/40 bg-paper rounded-sm\\\"\\n      />\\n      <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] text-ink-soft\\\">{label}</span>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\\nexport default function DevTextures() {\\n  const [lightMode, setLightMode] = React.useState<LightMode>(\\\"daylight\\\");\\n  const [tier, setTier] = React.useState<QualityTier>(\\\"high\\\");\\n  const [compareSideBySide, setCompareSideBySide] = React.useState(true);\\n  const [grainIntensity, setGrainIntensity] = React.useState<number>(1.0);\\n\\n  const lightConfig = React.useMemo(() => {\\n    if (lightMode === \\\"sunset\\\") {\\n      return { ambient: 0.45, ambientColor: \\\"#FFC9D6\\\", dir: 1.9, dirColor: \\\"#FFAA7A\\\" };\\n    }\\n    if (lightMode === \\\"lantern\\\") {\\n      return { ambient: 0.22, ambientColor: \\\"#75697E\\\", dir: 0.75, dirColor: \\\"#FFC75A\\\" };\\n    }\\n    return { ambient: 0.68, ambientColor: \\\"#FFF1F4\\\", dir: 1.85, dirColor: \\\"#FFE8C6\\\" };\\n  }, [lightMode]);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-28 pb-20\\\">\\n      <header className=\\\"mb-10 flex flex-col gap-5\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-end justify-between gap-4\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <p className=\\\"font-handwriting text-lg text-blossom-600\\\">dev inspector</p>\\n            <h1 className=\\\"font-display-tight text-4xl text-ink\\\">\\n              64\303\22764 Procedural PBR Block Materials\\n            </h1>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-ink-soft max-w-2xl\\\">\\n              Side-by-side comparison of original flat albedo textures versus Sobel normal-mapped\\n              materials with procedural height-map cavity relief on stone and cherry bark.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono text-xs text-ink-soft mr-1\\\">View:</span>\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setCompareSideBySide(true)}\\n                aria-pressed={compareSideBySide}\\n                className={cn(\\n                  \\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-sm border-2 text-xs font-bold cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\",\\n                  compareSideBySide\\n                    ? \\\"border-ink bg-blossom-200 text-ink shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\"\\n                    : \\\"border-ink/40 bg-paper text-ink-soft hover:border-ink\\\",\\n                )}\\n              >\\n                Side-by-Side\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setCompareSideBySide(false)}\\n                aria-pressed={!compareSideBySide}\\n                className={cn(\\n                  \\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-sm border-2 text-xs font-bold cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\",\\n                  !compareSideBySide\\n                    ? \\\"border-ink bg-blossom-200 text-ink shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\"\\n                    : \\\"border-ink/40 bg-paper text-ink-soft hover:border-ink\\\",\\n                )}\\n              >\\n                PBR Only\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono text-xs text-ink-soft mr-1\\\">Grain:</span>\\n              {GRAIN_PRESETS.map((preset) => (\\n                <button\\n                  key={preset.id}\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => setGrainIntensity(preset.value)}\\n                  aria-pressed={grainIntensity === preset.value}\\n                  className={cn(\\n                    \\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-sm border-2 text-xs font-bold cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\",\\n                    grainIntensity === preset.value\\n                      ? \\\"border-ink bg-amber/30 text-ink shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\"\\n                      : \\\"border-ink/40 bg-paper text-ink-soft hover:border-ink\\\",\\n                  )}\\n                >\\n                  {preset.label}\\n                </button>\\n              ))}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-2 border-t border-dashed border-paper-line\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"font-mono text-xs text-ink-soft mr-1\\\">Tier:</span>\\n            {([\\\"high\\\", \\\"medium\\\", \\\"low\\\"] as QualityTier[]).map((t) => (\\n              <button\\n                key={t}\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setTier(t)}\\n                aria-pressed={tier === t}\\n                className={cn(\\n                  \\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-sm border-2 text-xs font-bold capitalize cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\",\\n                  tier === t\\n                    ? \\\"border-ink bg-moss/20 text-ink shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\"\\n                    : \\\"border-ink/40 bg-paper text-ink-soft hover:border-ink\\\",\\n                )}\\n              >\\n                {t}\\n              </button>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"font-mono text-xs text-ink-soft mr-1\\\">Light:</span>\\n            {([\\\"daylight\\\", \\\"sunset\\\", \\\"lantern\\\"] as LightMode[]).map((mode) => (\\n              <button\\n                key={mode}\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setLightMode(mode)}\\n                aria-pressed={lightMode === mode}\\n                className={cn(\\n                  \\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-sm border-2 text-xs font-bold capitalize cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\",\\n                  lightMode === mode\\n                    ? \\\"border-ink bg-blossom-200 text-ink shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\"\\n                    : \\\"border-ink/40 bg-paper text-ink-soft hover:border-ink\\\",\\n                )}\\n              >\\n                {mode}\\n              </button>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </header>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-6\\\">\\n        {BLOCK_TYPES.map((type: BlockType) => {\\n          const hasMultiFace = type === \\\"grass\\\" || type === \\\"cherry_log\\\";\\n          const hasHeightRelief = usesHeightMapRelief(type);\\n          return (\\n            <div\\n              key={type}\\n              className=\\\"border-2 border-ink bg-paper-shade rounded-sm p-3.5 shadow-[3px_3px_0_var(--color-ink)]\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div\\n                className={cn(\\n                  \\\"h-40 w-full border border-ink/20 rounded-sm overflow-hidden\\\",\\n                  lightMode === \\\"lantern\\\" ? \\\"bg-[#221A28]\\\" : \\\"bg-paper\\\",\\n                )}\\n              >\\n                <Canvas\\n                  dpr={[1, 1.5]}\\n                  camera={{\\n                    position: compareSideBySide ? [0, 0.3, 4.1] : [0, 0.25, 3.1],\\n                    fov: compareSideBySide ? 38 : 36,\\n                  }}\\n                  gl={{ toneMapping: THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping }}\\n                >\\n                  <ambientLight\\n                    intensity={lightConfig.ambient}\\n                    color={lightConfig.ambientColor}\\n                  />\\n                  <directionalLight\\n                    position={[4, 6, 4]}\\n                    intensity={lightConfig.dir}\\n                    color={lightConfig.dirColor}\\n                  />\\n                  {compareSideBySide ? (\\n                    <>\\n                      <SpinningBlock\\n                        type={type}\\n                        tier={tier}\\n                        variant=\\\"flat\\\"\\n                        grainIntensity={0}\\n                        position={[-0.98, 0, 0]}\\n                        size={1.22}\\n                      />\\n                      <SpinningBlock\\n                        type={type}\\n                        tier={tier}\\n                        variant=\\\"pbr\\\"\\n                        grainIntensity={grainIntensity}\\n                        position={[0.98, 0, 0]}\\n                        size={1.22}\\n                      />\\n                    </>\\n                  ) : (\\n                    <SpinningBlock\\n                      type={type}\\n                      tier={tier}\\n                      variant=\\\"pbr\\\"\\n                      grainIntensity={grainIntensity}\\n                    />\\n                  )}\\n                </Canvas>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {compareSideBySide && (\\n                <div className=\\\"mt-1.5 grid grid-cols-2 text-center font-mono text-[10px] text-ink-soft\\\">\\n                  <span>Original (Flat)</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-bold text-ink\\\">\\n                    {hasHeightRelief ? \\\"PBR (Normal + Height)\\\" : \\\"PBR (Normal)\\\"}\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n                <p className=\\\"font-pixel text-base text-ink\\\">{type}</p>\\n                <span\\n                  className={cn(\\n                    \\\"font-mono text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border\\\",\\n                    hasHeightRelief\\n                      ? \\\"border-ink bg-amber/25 text-ink font-bold\\\"\\n                      : \\\"border-ink/30 bg-paper text-ink-soft\\\",\\n                  )}\\n                >\\n                  {hasHeightRelief ? \\\"normal + height\\\" : \\\"normal + rough\\\"}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"mt-3 pt-2.5 border-t border-dashed border-paper-line flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <TextureSwatch\\n                  type={type}\\n                  face=\\\"side\\\"\\n                  channel=\\\"albedo\\\"\\n                  label=\\\"side\\\"\\n                  grainIntensity={grainIntensity}\\n                />\\n                {hasMultiFace && (\\n                  <TextureSwatch\\n                    type={type}\\n                    face=\\\"top\\\"\\n                    channel=\\\"albedo\\\"\\n                    label=\\\"top\\\"\\n                    grainIntensity={grainIntensity}\\n                  />\\n                )}\\n                <TextureSwatch\\n                  type={type}\\n                  face=\\\"side\\\"\\n                  channel=\\\"normal\\\"\\n                  label=\\\"normal\\\"\\n                  grainIntensity={grainIntensity}\\n                />\\n                <TextureSwatch\\n                  type={type}\\n                  face=\\\"side\\\"\\n                  channel=\\\"roughness\\\"\\n                  label=\\\"rough\\\"\\n                  grainIntensity={grainIntensity}\\n                />\\n                {hasHeightRelief && (\\n                  <TextureSwatch\\n                    type={type}\\n                    face=\\\"side\\\"\\n                    channel=\\\"heightMap\\\"\\n                    label=\\\"height\\\"\\n                    grainIntensity={grainIntensity}\\n                  />\\n                )}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          );\\n        })}\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update DevTextures inspector with side-by-side Flat vs PBR comparison, surface grain intensity presets, and height map channel swatches for stone and bark\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/pages/DevTextures.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating DevTextures page\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update DevTextures.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\302\027\n\277\027\001i\024}\023\226wNr\371\270\342\'\243\262\311\2620\227\332\326\260D\275iF\264\346\257Q\327c\360\t\303\003V$\271\226\3554d\261\331p\275\365\354\331\347Ibo\272\357\312\016\206\230wS\277\307\202\016\307\2223\217\253\021q9\367\255\250\263\271\310\300\261\255\222G\225\371\246\343`(\324X\231p<\230\314\316\353`\017\216\016\240\3239\005\365\017\221M\307\247V\177NM\177#8/\023-\2504w2\373;\345\367^\331B\321A\356\255S1\237]\263\032k\211c\260\037\252\364\214+\327R\327\331\205\206\326k\"\376\036d\032\027\327$\302\024|\360\v\243\204\302\227\315!\035&\002\274b\023\304\257\324\367\333\330\322\245\223M\327p\342\025\213\344\031\213\213u\364\204R\230f\341\203\360\031\235\337d\037\017p\226U\234\377>\243\244b\223\250z\036\005\312\332\373\034\332\206h\2221V*\312I\"\377\305\203\240\374\215\256\315\230\275I#Eu\216\375\016n\a\357\326\270-\034ET\027!,:yS\351I\203\202\351\241n\033\245\341`FE\371\310\317\355\247_\265\212\232\356\033X\3269\312.\372\323d\305\372\225V\352\3116\260\370\005\224\304\341\2204\335\202\346r4\302\333I#d\025Zj\3132\354\256\376\344\331,m\205xrTZ|\361\217\342p\033\340\352\324\324M\315\340c-\261\330\361\333\261\333\240\252\002_!\352\277\364\000\2147\301\340\002Ar\322;\037a\366\313\341\3322j\327!^\343\346\226\030\366\376\370\ta\201\2457\3608\260\255\023w\211e\177):\003g\237\204\034\027pr\\~k\311\271\017\232\255sp\004\252\316y\377\032Yc\303Gm\303,\211\335\257\316\355\260\214gD0\322\240\320d\r\005\271\222\365\245p}a\327+n\264\212\344[\233\2170I\033\272\330\021\265\216\347dAf$\240\031T-\t\002\026\366\276\302D{u*-m\036\026\234;\233\224+\262\230\243\372\215!\006\216\005\025\274\322C\r^\3668\371X[a\305\201\330\306\027\320\261I\037\274\266\375;\235\264\257\301\272\0007\325\r\330\ro\263\214\306s\362\276Gc\342\207\034\036?ozZ\367^v\330\367\336\307\ad\021\336ik\222\302\003\277\216\006v\270%\342\340\342\254\363&\210\353aQ\220\336\267t\360<r\343\3567\3244 D46o/p\300\314h\002\034\r\250\237w\321\344\335\242\314a\333,A\342K\v_c4l\244[\224]