  planner_response {
    response: "Updated the procedural voxel material pipeline and the `/dev/textures` inspector page:\n\n- **Procedural Height-Map Relief (`stone`, `deep_stone`, `cherry_log`)**:\n  - Added deterministic `64\303\22764` height-map generation (`paintHeightMap`, `usesHeightMapRelief`) alongside multi-scale stone strata/fissures and bark furrows/lenticel striations.\n  - Derived a crevice-only cavity AO texture (`deriveCavityAoFromHeight`) wired to `MeshStandardMaterial.aoMap` (`channel = 0`) so cracks and bark furrows deepen under directional and ambient light while raised facets retain their full sketchbook palette brightness.\n  - Added `MaterialOptions` (`variant: \"pbr\" | \"flat\"` and `grainIntensity`) to `getBlockMaterial` while preserving the default 3-argument signature used by the 3D island scene.\n- **Side-by-Side Comparison & Grain Controls (`/dev/textures`)**:\n  - Added a **View** toggle (**Side-by-Side** vs **PBR Only**) rendering synchronized **Original (Flat)** vs **PBR (Normal / Normal + Height)** cubes within each card\'s shared WebGL `<Canvas>`.\n  - Added **Grain** intensity presets (**Subtle 0.5\303\227**, **Balanced 1.0\303\227**, **Rich 1.8\303\227**) that dynamically update both 3D block materials and 2D texture swatches (`side`, `top`, `normal`, `rough`, plus `height` on `stone`, `deep_stone`, and `cherry_log`).\n- **Verification**:\n  - All 41 unit tests passed (`textures.test.ts`, `islandGenerator.test.ts`, `content.test.ts`, `sections.test.tsx`, `doodle-crew-footer.test.ts`).\n  - `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`) succeeded with zero errors.\n  - Headless Chromium checks on `/dev/textures` (across Side-by-Side and Rich 1.8\303\227 grain states) and `/` confirmed crisp normal/height relief, sketchbook compatibility, and zero console errors."
    message_id: "tIkAa9qqAb_pz7IP4_XcuQU"
    modified_response: "Updated the procedural voxel material pipeline and the `/dev/textures` inspector page:\n\n- **Procedural Height-Map Relief (`stone`, `deep_stone`, `cherry_log`)**:\n  - Added deterministic `64\303\22764` height-map generation (`paintHeightMap`, `usesHeightMapRelief`) alongside multi-scale stone strata/fissures and bark furrows/lenticel striations.\n  - Derived a crevice-only cavity AO texture (`deriveCavityAoFromHeight`) wired to `MeshStandardMaterial.aoMap` (`channel = 0`) so cracks and bark furrows deepen under directional and ambient light while raised facets retain their full sketchbook palette brightness.\n  - Added `MaterialOptions` (`variant: \"pbr\" | \"flat\"` and `grainIntensity`) to `getBlockMaterial` while preserving the default 3-argument signature used by the 3D island scene.\n- **Side-by-Side Comparison & Grain Controls (`/dev/textures`)**:\n  - Added a **View** toggle (**Side-by-Side** vs **PBR Only**) rendering synchronized **Original (Flat)** vs **PBR (Normal / Normal + Height)** cubes within each card\'s shared WebGL `<Canvas>`.\n  - Added **Grain** intensity presets (**Subtle 0.5\303\227**, **Balanced 1.0\303\227**, **Rich 1.8\303\227**) that dynamically update both 3D block materials and 2D texture swatches (`side`, `top`, `normal`, `rough`, plus `height` on `stone`, `deep_stone`, and `cherry_log`).\n- **Verification**:\n  - All 41 unit tests passed (`textures.test.ts`, `islandGenerator.test.ts`, `content.test.ts`, `sections.test.tsx`, `doodle-crew-footer.test.ts`).\n  - `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`) succeeded with zero errors.\n  - Headless Chromium checks on `/dev/textures` (across Side-by-Side and Rich 1.8\303\227 grain states) and `/` confirmed crisp normal/height relief, sketchbook compatibility, and zero console errors."
