 Singapore, Miami & India | Petalnodes\",/app/applet/src/App.tsx:51:      \"Petalnodes global server locations across Singapore (SG), Miami (USA), and India (IN) powered by Ryzen & Xeon Gold hardware.\",/app/applet/src/App.tsx:66:      \"Learn about Petalnodes Cherry Blossom Minecraft and VPS infrastructure across Singapore, Miami, and India.\",/app/applet/src/App.tsx:167:              <Route path=\"/bots\" element={<BotHosting />} />/app/applet/src/index.css:129:    to bottom,/app/applet/src/index.css:164:  animation: stamp-squash 0.42s cubic-bezier(0.3, 1.5, 0.5, 1) both;/app/applet/src/content/content.test.ts:6:  botHosting,/app/applet/src/content/content.test.ts:111:test(\"listTodos tracks remaining unconfirmed URLs, bot draft specs, and legal review markers\", () => {/app/applet/src/content/content.test.ts:121:  assert.ok(paths.has(\"botHosting.supportedRuntimesTodo\"));/app/applet/src/content/content.test.ts:136:    botHosting,/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:62:export interface BotPlanDraft {/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:112:    \"Minecraft and VPS hosting across Singapore, Miami, and India on AMD Ryzen & Intel Xeon Gold hardware with DDR5, NVMe storage, DDoS protection, and daily backups.\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:136:  bots: \"/bots\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:246:    cardLine: \"Compact KVM Linux node for bots, proxies, or lightweight services.\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:308:    \"Hardware varies across our Singapore, Miami, and India locations. Not every VPS node uses the same processor model or location-specific configuration.\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:335:    { label: \"Mass Ping\", penalty: \"Invite Reset\" },/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:359:export const botHosting = {/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:360:  eyebrow: \"bot hosting \302\267 awaiting confirmation\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:361:  heading: \"Keep your community bots blooming.\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:363:  sub: \"Dedicated Discord and community bot hosting backed by NVMe storage, DDoS protection, and panel management.\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:365:    \"Bot Hosting plan names, pricing, CPU/RAM/storage allocations, and supported language runtimes are awaiting final confirmation from the Petalnodes team.\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:368:  supportedRuntimesTodo: \"TODO: confirm supported bot languages and runtimes (e.g. Node.js, Python, Java)\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:391:      paymenterUrl: \"TODO: Bot Hosting Tier 1 URL\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:400:      paymenterUrl: \"TODO: Bot Hosting Tier 2 URL\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:409:      paymenterUrl: \"TODO: Bot Hosting Tier 3 URL\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:411:  ] as BotPlanDraft[],/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:426:    { label: \"Bot Hosting\", to: \"/bots\" },/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:451:      body: \"Fast servers across Singapore, Miami, and India with Paper, Purpur, and Fabric support, daily backups included, and real humans on Discord. Every world starts as a little sapling.\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:460:      body: \"Our infrastructure pairs AMD Ryzen and Intel Xeon Gold processors with DDR5 memory and fast NVMe storage across Singapore, Miami, and India.\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:465:        { label: \"Locations\", value: \"SG \302\267 Miami \302\267 IN\" },/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:503:        { label: \"Locations\", value: \"SG \302\267 Miami \302\267 IN\" },/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:539:    { id: \"locations\", label: \"Locations\", value: \"Singapore \302\267 Miami \302\267 India\", icon: \"globe\" as const },/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:559:        \"Petalnodes provides Cherry Blossom Minecraft hosting, KVM Linux VPS servers, Discord rewards, and upcoming bot hosting with real Discord support.\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:577:        \"Both! Java & Bedrock support is included across our paid Minecraft plans and Bloom Discord Boost reward tiers.\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:595:        \"We have infrastructure in Singapore (SG), Miami (USA), and India (IN).\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:629:    \"Minecraft & VPS hosting grown with care. Singapore, Miami, and India regions with NVMe storage, daily backups, and real humans on Discord.\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:642:        { label: \"Bot Hosting\", href: links.bots },/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:723:      says: \"SG, Miami, or India \342\200\224 take your pick.\",/app/applet/src/content/index.ts:782:    botHosting,/app/applet/src/content/pages.ts:2:  id: \"sg\" | \"miami\" | \"in\";/app/applet/src/content/pages.ts:17:  sub: \"Petalnodes operates Minecraft and VPS infrastructure across Singapore, Miami, and India so friends and communities can host closer to home.\",/app/applet/src/content/pages.ts:31:      id: \"miami\",/app/applet/src/content/pages.ts:33:      city: \"Miami\",/app/applet/src/content/pages.ts:104:            \"Confirm your server region (Singapore, Miami, or India) and start your instance from the console view.\",/app/applet/src/content/pages.ts:139:      description: \"Confirmed support for both Java Edition and Bedrock Edition worlds.\",/app/applet/src/content/pages.ts:144:          summary: \"Both paid Minecraft plans and Bloom Boost Rewards include Java & Bedrock support.\",/app/applet/src/content/pages.ts:252:            \"Check https://status.petalnodes.cloud to verify regional node health (Singapore, Miami, India).\",/app/applet/src/content/pages.ts:294:        \"Adds deep gameplay and entity behavior toggles while keeping full Paper plugin compatibility.\",/app/applet/src/content/pages.ts:336:      body: \"Our nodes run on AMD Ryzen and Intel Xeon Gold processors, DDR5 memory, and NVMe storage across Singapore, Miami, and India \342\200\224 protected by DDoS mitigation and Cloudflare.\",/app/applet/src/content/pages.ts:429:        body: \"Petal invite servers and Bloom Discord boost reward servers are claimed via Discord Support Tickets. Free invite rewards remain subject to invite-integrity rules (Member Leave \342\210\2222, Rejoin \342\210\2221, Fake/Alt \342\210\2222, Mass Ping Invite Reset). Bloom boost rewards require active boosts to be maintained.\",/app/applet/src/content/pages.ts:477:        body: \"Infrastructure incidents and regional availability across Singapore, Miami, and India are communicated via https://status.petalnodes.cloud and Discord.\","
    }
