  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 4
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nContinuing development on the **Petalnodes** React + Vite + TypeScript + Three.js application (`/app/applet`).\nCore goal from the active user prompt (**FINAL TODO ELIMINATION, BOT HOSTING LAUNCH & VPS OPTIMIZATION**):\n1. **Audit the actual repository & run `npm run check:release`** (previously 57 TODOs: 18 blocking URL TODOs + 39 Fact/Copy TODOs).\n2. **Complete all independent TODOs/improvements safely** without hiding TODOs or inventing unconfirmed business facts (keep owner-blocked items explicitly tracked via `listTodos()` + `TODO` markers).\n3. **Bot Hosting Product Category (`/bots` + sitewide integration)**:\n   - Design a complete 5-tier botanical-themed Bot Hosting draft lineup (`Pollen` \342\206\222 `Dewdrop` \342\206\222 `Nectar` \342\206\222 `Petal` \342\206\222 `Blossom`) with proposed INR pricing, guaranteed RAM, shared fair-use CPU limits (no unlimited CPU), NVMe storage, use cases, comparison table, and FAQs \342\200\224 all marked **DRAFT / OWNER APPROVAL REQUIRED** with disabled checkout buttons (never fake Paymenter URLs).\n   - Infrastructure must strictly specify **Miami, USA VPS infrastructure only** (never Singapore or India).\n   - Integrate Bot Hosting into Homepage categories, Nav, Footer, Locations, Comparison matrix, FAQs, Docs, and SEO metadata.\n4. **Miami Location & ~2ms Ping Investigation**:\n   - Audited entire repo (`grep` returned 0 hits for `2ms`, `latency`, `ping`, IP addresses, or traceroutes). No verified datacenter facility or probe measurement exists. Therefore, publish only **\"Miami, USA (VPS Infrastructure)\"** and track `miamiLatencyTodo` in `src/content/index.ts` instead of fabricating or publishing a universal `2ms` customer latency claim.\n5. **VPS Hosting Finalization (`/vps`)**:\n   - Keep exact 5 confirmed plans (`Root` 4GB \342\202\271300, `Branch` 6GB \342\202\271500, `Trunk` 8GB \342\202\271800, `Canopy` 12GB \342\202\2711,200, `Evergrove` 16GB \342\202\2711,600), 8 confirmed specs, and 6 infra items (AMD Ryzen, Intel Xeon Gold, DDR5, NVMe, Cloudflare, DDoS).\n   - Add workload use cases, region availability (`Singapore`, `Miami`, `India` + hardware/IPv4 variance notes), VPS FAQs, Minecraft vs VPS vs Bot Hosting comparison, and functional Store fallback routing while per-plan Paymenter URLs remain TODO.\n6. **Complete Documentation (`/docs`)**:\n   - Cover all 12 prioritized topics (`Getting Started`, `Creating a Minecraft Server`, `Java & Bedrock`, `Paper, Purpur, and Fabric`, `Installing Plugins`, `File Management`, `Server Backups`, `Server Configuration`, `Troubleshooting`, `Billing and Account Access`, plus NEW `11. VPS Getting Started` and `12. Bot Hosting Getting Started (Draft)`), fixing the hardcoded `\"10 topics\"` label.\n7. **Legal & Policy Drafts (`/terms`, `/privacy`, `/sla`)**:\n   - Improve structure, cross-navigation tabs, section anchors (`#id`), and TOC without inventing entity name, address, jurisdiction, refund rules, retention periods, or SLA uptime/credits.\n8. **Ask Owner One Question at a Time** for remaining owner-blocked details (starting with the highest priority blocker), and deliver the complete 15-point Phase 13 report after full verification.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Skills Read\n- `ultra-mode` (`/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md`)\n- `frontend-design` (`/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`) + `references/2_landing_marketing.md`\n- `applet-seo` (`/skills/system_skills/applet_seo/SKILL.md`)\n- `computer-use` (`/skills/system_skills/computer_use/SKILL.md`) \342\200\224 read before compaction; note `playwright-cli` container rules.\n\n### Baseline Checks Run Before Latest Edits\n- Initial `npm run check:release` exited 1 with **57 TODOs** (`18` Blocking URLs, `39` Fact/Copy TODOs).\n- `grep -rnEi \'2ms|latency|miami|ping|bot\'` confirmed **0 latency measurements / datacenter specs** in repo.\n- Previous task\'s `/dev/textures` & `textures.ts` height/AO work already passed 41 tests and visual inspection prior to the current request.\n\n### Code Edits Completed (UNCOMPILED & UNTESTED AFTER THESE EDITS!)\n1. `/src/content/index.ts` (rewritten):\n   - Updated `brand.oneLiner`, `brand.metaTitle`, `brand.metaDescription`, `story.chapters[0].eyebrow`, `faq.items` (updated #1, #7, added #10 for Bot Hosting), `footerConfig.blurb`.\n   - Added `hostingCategories` (Minecraft, KVM VPS, Bot Hosting Draft) and `serviceComparison` (5-row matrix comparing Minecraft vs VPS vs Bot Hosting).\n   - Added `vpsSection.locationAvailability`, `vpsSection.useCases` (4), and `vpsSection.faqs` (5).\n   - Upgraded `botHosting` to 5 botanical draft plans (`Pollen` 512MB/50% CPU/3GB/\342\202\27139, `Dewdrop` 1GB/100%/6GB/\342\202\27169, `Nectar` 2GB/150%/10GB/\342\202\271119 *recommended*, `Petal` 4GB/200%/15GB/\342\202\271199, `Blossom` 6GB/250%/25GB/\342\202\271279), all marked `isDraft: true` with `paymenterUrl: \"TODO: Bot Hosting Tier 1..5 URL\"`, plus `infrastructureLocation: \"Miami, USA (VPS Infrastructure)\"`, `miamiLatencyTodo`, `draftApprovalTodo`, `capabilitiesConfirmed`, `capabilitiesProposed`, `useCases`, and `faqs`.\n2. `/src/content/pages.ts` (rewritten):\n   - Updated `locationsPage` to include `\"Bot Hosting Infrastructure (Draft)\"` ONLY on Miami (`locations[0]`) and added `botLocationNote`.\n   - Expanded `docsPage.categories` to all **12 topics** (added #11 `VPS Getting Started` and #12 `Bot Hosting Getting Started (Draft)`), preserving honest TODO notes for Geyser/Bedrock port (#3), Forge/NeoForge/Velocity (#4), Backup retention days (#7), and Bot runtime confirmation (#12).\n   - Added `id` slugs and expanded draft clauses in `legalDocs` (`terms`, `privacy`, `sla`) while preserving all owner-approval `todoMarker` fields.\n3. `/src/sections/shared/HostingComparison.tsx` (created): reusable 3-column comparison table (`Minecraft Hosting`, `KVM VPS Hosting`, `Bot Hosting (Draft)`).\n4. `/src/sections/home/HostingCategories.tsx` (created): 3-card showcase on `/` linking to `/plans`, `/vps`, and `/bots`.\n5. `/src/pages/Home.tsx` (updated): renders `<HostingCategories />` between `<PlansHighlight />` and `<TrustStrip />`.\n6. `/src/sections/home/PlansHighlight.tsx` (updated): added quick link `Preview Bot Hosting (Miami) \342\206\222` to `/bots`.\n7. `/src/pages/BotHosting.tsx` (rewritten): renders draft approval banner, Miami VPS infra card (fair-use explanation), 5 botanical cards with disabled `\"Draft \342\200\224 Awaiting Approval\"` buttons (no dead/fake checkout links), 5-column comparison table, Verified vs Proposed capabilities grid, 4 workload cards, `<HostingComparison />`, and 4 Bot FAQs.\n8. `/src/pages/VpsHosting.tsx` (rewritten): while `isTodo(plan.paymenterUrl)` is true, card & table CTAs route to `links.store` (`https://billing.petalnodes.cloud`) with `\"Order via Billing Store \342\206\222\"` + caption `\"Direct plan link pending \302\267 select <Name> at billing.petalnodes.cloud\"`; added Use Cases section, Available Regions card (`SG / Miami / IN`), `<HostingComparison />`, and VPS FAQs accordion.\n9. `/src/pages/Docs.tsx` (updated): dynamic `{docsPage.categories.length} topics \302\267 pick a chapter` (`12 topics`), `aria-pressed` on category buttons, searches `article.note` too.\n10. `/src/pages/LegalPage.tsx` (updated): added policy switcher nav (`/terms`, `/privacy`, `/sla`), `\"In this draft\"` section TOC with smooth-anchor `scroll-mt-24`, and `Client Area` CTA.\n11. `/src/pages/Locations.tsx` (updated): defaulted spotlight to `\"miami\"`, displays `loc.botInfraNote` and `locationsPage.botLocationNote`, converted clickable `<div onClick>` location cards into keyboard-accessible `<button type=\"button\" aria-pressed={active}>`, added `\"Bot Hosting (Miami)\"` CTA button.\n12. `/src/components/sketch/StickerButton.tsx` (updated): sets `aria-disabled=\"true\"` on anchor links when `todoHref` is true (preserving `href` for existing `PlanCard` test).\n13. `/src/App.tsx` & `/index.html` (updated): updated `ROUTE_META` titles/descriptions, synced `og:url`, and updated `<title>` / meta descriptions for Minecraft, VPS & Bot Hosting.\n\n### Not Yet Updated / Run After Edits\n- Tests (`src/content/content.test.ts`, `src/sections/sections.test.tsx`) have NOT been updated or executed yet.\n- TypeScript lint (`lint_applet`), Vite production build (`compile_applet` / `npm run build`), `npm run check:release`, and `playwright-cli` visual browser checks have NOT been run yet since the edits above.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Important TODO Count Change**: Expanding `botHosting.plans` from 3 to 5 tiers (`Pollen`..`Blossom`) + adding `miamiLatencyTodo` and `draftApprovalTodo` + setting concrete draft specs (`512 MB`..`6 GB`, `\342\202\27139`..`\342\202\271279`) instead of `\"TODO\"` strings in the 12 old `botHosting.plans[0..2].{ram,cpu,storage,priceMonthly}` fields will change the `npm run check:release` count! Make sure to run `npm run check:release` after these edits and report the **exact new live output** (do not quote the stale 57 number!). Also check `BotHosting.tsx` for `sections.test.tsx:188`: `assert.ok(botHtml.includes(\"TODO\"));` \342\200\224 `BotHosting.tsx` DOES include `\"DRAFT / TODO\"` Stamp and `supportedRuntimesTodo`, so verify whether `sections.test.tsx` passes cleanly!\n- **StickerButton / PlanCard Bug Check**:\n  - In `PlanCard.tsx` (`/plans`), buttons still render `<a href=\"TODO: Seed Paymenter URL\" aria-disabled=\"true\">` because `sections.test.tsx:84` asserts `sproutHtml.includes(\\`href=\"${sprout.paymenterUrl}\"\\`)`. Check if adding a subtle `\"Direct checkout link pending \342\200\224 Order at billing.petalnodes.cloud\"` link/note in `PlanCard.tsx` improves `/plans` UX cleanly without breaking `sections.test.tsx`!\n- **Browser Extension Error (`Cannot set property fetch of #<Window>`)**: Confirmed from prior inspection that `chrome-extension://eppiocemhmnlbhjplcgkofciiegomcon` causes errors 0 and 1 externally; zero occurrences exist in `src/` or `index.html`. Verify in clean headless Chromium via `playwright-cli` console checks on all routes.\n- **Dev server**: Uses `DISABLE_HMR=true`. Always call `restart_dev_server` after fixing any code/build issues before running `playwright-cli`.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- Earlier in session (before current prompt):\n  - `view_file` failed on `/src/components/sketch/DevTodoBadge.tsx` (actual path is `/src/components/layout/DevTodoBadge.tsx`). Resolved.\n  - Note: avoided forbidden marketing words (`unleash`, `elevate`, `seamless`, etc.) tested by `src/content/content.test.ts`! Check `content.test.ts` passes cleanly with new copy.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Workspace: `/app/applet`.\n- Unverified modified/created files:\n  - `src/content/index.ts`, `src/content/pages.ts`\n  - `src/sections/shared/HostingComparison.tsx`, `src/sections/home/HostingCategories.tsx`, `src/sections/home/PlansHighlight.tsx`\n  - `src/pages/Home.tsx`, `src/pages/BotHosting.tsx`, `src/pages/VpsHosting.tsx`, `src/pages/Docs.tsx`, `src/pages/LegalPage.tsx`, `src/pages/Locations.tsx`\n  - `src/components/sketch/StickerButton.tsx`, `src/App.tsx`, `index.html`\n\n## 6. Next Steps (Exact Order)\n1. **Update & Expand Unit/SSR Tests**:\n   - Check `src/content/content.test.ts` and `src/sections/sections.test.tsx` \342\200\224 add assertions covering:\n     - 5 botanical `botHosting.plans` (`pollen`..`blossom`), `\342\202\27139`..`\342\202\271279` proposed drafts, Miami-only infrastructure, no unlimited CPU claims, no `2ms` global ping claim.\n     - `hostingCategories` & `serviceComparison` covering all 3 products.\n     - All 12 `docsPage.categories` including `vps-getting-started` and `bot-hosting-getting-started`.\n     - SSR checks verifying `/bots` renders `Pollen (Draft)`..`Blossom (Draft)` + disabled approval button, `/vps` renders all 5 plans + `HostingComparison` + FAQs + `billing.petalnodes.cloud` fallback CTA, `/terms`, `/privacy`, `/sla` cross-navigation & TOC, `/locations` Miami Bot Hosting note.\n2. **Run Full Code Verification & Release Check**:\n   - Run `npx --yes tsx --test src/content/content.test.ts src/sections/sections.test.tsx src/three/island/textures.test.ts src/three/island/islandGenerator.test.ts src/components/ui/doodle-crew-footer.test.ts`.\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` (`vite build`) and `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`).\n   - Run `npm run check:release` and record its exact updated TODO breakdown (blocking URLs + fact/copy TODOs) and inspect static HTML fallback / `prefers-reduced-motion` behavior (`Story` vs `StoryStatic` \342\200\224 inspect `src/sections/home/Story.tsx` if needed to confirm reduced-motion compatibility!).\n3. **Restart Dev Server & Headless Browser Verification (`playwright-cli`)**:\n   - Run `restart_dev_server`.\n   - Verify rendered pages cleanly in headless Chromium (`playwright-cli open --browser=chromium`, `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`, check `playwright-cli console` for `0` app/extension errors):\n     - Desktop (`1440\303\227900`): `/` (`HostingCategories`), `/bots` (banner, Miami infra card, 5 plan cards, comparison table, verified vs proposed features), `/vps` (cards, comparison, use cases, FAQs), `/docs` (check `12 topics \302\267 pick a chapter`, search `\'VPS\'` & `\'Bot\'`), `/terms` (tabs + TOC), `/locations`, `/404-test` (`NotFound`).\n     - Mobile (`390\303\227844`): verify zero horizontal overflow (`document.documentElement.scrollWidth <= window.innerWidth`) across `/`, `/bots`, `/vps`, `/docs`, `/plans`.\n     - Visually inspect key captures (keep screenshots <= 4 and use snapshots for DOM verification per `ultra-mode`!) and fix any layout/contrast/overflow defects if found, then re-verify cleanly.\n   - Remove `.playwright-cli/` after visual verification.\n4. **Final Output to Owner**:\n   - Deliver the concise structured **15-point Phase 13 report** (referencing exact live `npm run check:release` counts, verified tests/build/typecheck/browser checks, honest separation of Petalnodes app vs Chrome extension vs external blockers, Miami `2ms` audit finding).\n   - End by asking **exactly ONE prioritized Owner Question** (Question #1: **Missing Minecraft Paymenter checkout URLs for Seed through Sakura**, or let owner confirm/skip).\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Never invent prices (only mark proposed Bot Hosting prices as DRAFT awaiting approval), URLs, legal entity details, backup retention days, refund windows, uptime SLAs, CPU models/speeds, or `2ms` Miami latency guarantees.\n- Bot Hosting must NEVER be linked to Singapore or India infrastructure \342\200\224 Miami, USA only.\n- Never activate clickable checkout links (`href=\"TODO:...\"`) on Bot Hosting draft plans; keep them disabled until owner approves & provides real URLs.\n- Preserve Cherry Blossom Sketchbook aesthetic and all confirmed existing data (`Seed`..`Sakura`, `Root`..`Evergrove`, `Petal I\342\200\223VI`, `Bloom I\342\200\223IV`).\n- Ask **exactly ONE owner question at a time** at the end.\n- Use global `playwright-cli` directly with headless Chromium, `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`, unique `.playwright-cli/` filenames, and delete `.playwright-cli/` afterward.\n</summary>"
